<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Sinthongei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tîrtonngei SINTHONGEI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sinthongei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sin</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tîrtonngei an</para>
  <para style="mt1">SINTHONGEI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Tîrtonngei Sintho bu hi “Thurchisa” Luke</char> bu sûizomna ranga miziek ani. Akhîn lientak chu Jisua ruoisi masa ngei han Ratha Inthieng ruoina nuoia jerusalema, Judea ram le Samari ram pumpui ngeia le kôlmongngei dêna ama Thurchi Sa an lei minzar tie misîr hi ani (1:8). Mahi Khristien hong insôn tie, Judangei lâi renga rammuol pumpui ta ranga taksôna inkhat hong changna thurchi ani. A miziekpu ngei khomin a porengei ânthâr taka an minriet nôk nuom chu Khristienngei hi Rom sorkar doina pâl ni tet mak ngei, male Khristien taksôna hi Juda sakhuo tuon mintungpu ani uol.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Tîrton Sinthongei</char> hih buk inthumin Jisua Thurchi Sa hih adik tia phuongna le koiindangngei minding tira a ram an minzar tit târ minlangin: (1) jerusalema Khristien sintho hong inphut renga Jisua invâna a kal tena Thurchi; (2) Palistine ram muntina ahong inzar titir thurchi; (3) Mediterranean ram sûng pumpuia Rome khopui ten dênin ahong inzar uol tie thurchi ngei hah ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Tîrton Sinthongeia</char> sintho kâm omtak chu Ratha Inthieng sintho hi ani. Pentecost nia jerusalema iempungei chunga sinthotheina leh juong chuma koiindang le koiindang ruoipungei zoratina ruoia a mohôk minrât titpu tia Lekhabua târ minlang hah ani. Khristien masa ngei chongbe hih thurchi misîrnangeia pom ania Tîrton <char style="bk">Sinthongeia</char> lei minchuong ngei hin iempungei ringnuna le koiindang inzom khômna ngei khoma hi chongbe hin ranak adôn tiin aminlang ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Rietpuipu nitheina ranga insiemna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Jisua chongpêk le chonginkhâm nûktak <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Judas ruthûl thangna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalema rietpuipu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Judea le Samari rama rietpuipu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paul sinthona thurchi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Missionary khuolse voikhatna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Jerusalema inkhompui <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Missionary khuolse voinikna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Missionary khuolse voithumna <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Jerusalem, Caesarea le Rom Paul intâng ina aom chungroi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Moroitak, Theophilus: <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk 1:1-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Ke lekhabu motontaka han, Jisua'n sintho aphut lâia a sintho le a minchuna chongngei hah ki mizieka <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>invân tienga tuongin aom ni tena rilnangei hah. Tuongin a om mân han, a tîrton ranga a thang miriemngei kôm han Ratha Inthieng ranakin chongpêk a pêk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Athi suole a ring nôk ti an riet minthâr theina rangin sûn sômminli sûng hah chu vêl tamtak an kôm ânlâra, a chongpui ngeia, Pathien Rêngram thurchi a ril ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk 24:49</ref></char></note> Male munkhatin an intûp lehan, ma chongkhâm hih a pêk ngei ani: “Jerusalem mâk no roi, nangni ki misîr pe ngâi neinun manboipêk hah lei ngâk roi, ka Pa'n ânkhâm hah. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>John han tuiin a Baptis ngâia, aniatachu sûn tômte suole nangni chu Ratha Inthiengin baptis chang nin tih,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mk 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Joh 1:33</ref> </char></note> a tia.<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua invâna tuongin aom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Hanchu an intûpkhôm nôka, “Pumapa atûn hin mo Israelngei Rêngram ni minding nôk rang?” tiin tîrtonngeiin an rekela.<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Hanchu, Jisua'n an kôm, “Azorangei le anikhuo chu ka Pa'n ama rachama om ranga a dar ani, anni ngei hah nin lei riet rang nimak. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Hannirese, Ratha Inthieng nin chunga ajuong tika chu sinthotheina la dôn nin tih, hanchu jerusalema, Judea le Samari ram pumpui ngeia, kôlkung dênin ko chong rietpuipungei nîng nin tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mk 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk 24:47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref></char></note> a tia. <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Hanchu ma chong hah a ril suole chu an mu chungchakin invân tieng tuongin a oma, an muphâk khâi loina sûmin a tuongpai zoia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24:50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Ha anga invâna a se an thîr lâitakin mi inik puonchek insilin an kôm inningloiin an juon dinga. <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>“Galilee mingei, ithomo invân tieng tanga nin inding chien? Hi Jisua nin kôm renga invâna tuonga ompu hih invâna ranga lâka aom nin mu angtakin la juong kîr nôk ngêt a tih,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Juda Iscariot ruthûl an thang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Hanchu, tîrtonngei hah Olive Muol renga jerusalema an kîr nôk zoia, ma muol hah Jerusalem renga kilometer inkhat dôra ala ani. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mk 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk 6:14-16</ref></char></note> Hanchu Khopuilien hah an lûta an omna ngâi khâltan chunginta han an kala: anni ngei hah Peter, John, Jakob, Andrew, Philip, Thomas, Bartholomew, Matthew, Alfai nâipasal Jakob, Zelot Simon le Jakob nâipasal Judas an ni. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Anrêngin nupangngei hah, Jisua nû Mary le Jisua urêngngei le mulung inruol takin chubaitho rangin an intûp bang ngâi ani.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Sûn tômte suole chu iempungei an intûpkhôma razakhat sômnik an nia, ha ngei lâia han Peter chong rangin ândinga. <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>“Ka champuingei, Ratha Inthiengin Jisua sûrpu ranga aruoipu Judas roi David bâia alei ril chong hah atung rang piel ani. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Ama hah ei kôma kop ngâi mi ania, hi ei sinthona hin khom rangtum dôn ranga alei thang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>(Ama han saloi thona sum a man lehan mun inkhat a rochôka, ha muna han a thia a von apuok khoia arîlngei aterhet ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18,19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat 27:3-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Ha roi hah jerusalema om murdi'n an rieta, masikin ma mun hah an chongin, Akeldama an tia ma mun hah “Thisen mun,” tina ani.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Lap 69:25</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Lap 109:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Lapuibua hi anghin ânzieka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘A omna in lei ram senla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">asûnga tute omno rese ngei’ ti le.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">‘A sina mun midangin chang rese ngei.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Ti hih miziekin alei om.<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21,22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mk 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Luk 24:51</ref></char>
    </note> “Masikin, a ruthûl rang thang ngêt rang anânga, ei lâia tumakhat Pumapa Jisua sintho le sêna-hongna a rietpuipu ei lâia mi, John Baptis tholâi renga Jisua invâna a kal ni tena ama hah eini leh munkhata inthoinôkna rietpuipu ni rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Masikin mi inik: Joseph, Barsabbas an ti (Justus khom an ti sa ngâi) le Matthias an zena. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Masuole chu chubai an thoa, “Pumapa, nangman miriem mulungrîl murdi rietpu hi ngei inik hih tutak hi mo na thang mi min riet roh. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Judas ama muna a se theina ranga hi tîrton sin a mâkrak mun thûl rangin,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Hanchu taruo an sâna, an taruosân hah Matthias chunga achula, ha anghan Matthias hah tîrton sômleikhat ngei lâia telsa ani zoi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ratha Inthieng juong tung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Och 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Bal 16:9-11</ref></char>
    </note> Pentecost ni ahong tungin chu iempungei hah anrêngin mun khata an intûpkhôma. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Inningloi rengin invân renga phâivuopui angati rahang ajuong tung zuta, an insungna in hah ajuong sip zita. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Melei anga om meidon insem inzarin an mua, an chunga achuong chita. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Anrêngin Ratha Inthiengin an sip zita, Ratha'n a min chong ngei angtakin chong dangin an chong zoia.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Hanchu muntin renga hong Juda sakhuo mingei jerusalema an châma. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Ma rahang hah an rietin chu, mi tamtak an hong intûpa, mitinin iempungei chong hah anni an chong chit angin an riet sikin an mulung sûnga an kamâma. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>an mulung ajînga, kamâmruoi khom an ti oka, “En ta, hi a chongngei murdi hih Galilee rama mi nimak ngei mo! <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>I angin mo ei rêngin ei inzirpui chong ang chita ei riet thei hih? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Senkhat Parthia mi, Media mi, Elam mingei ei nia, senkhat Mesopotamia rama om, Judea rama om, Cappadocia ram, Pontus le Asia rama om, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Phrygia le Pamphylia ram, Egypt le Libya rama Cyrene khuo kôl revêla omngei ei nia, senkhat Rom khuo renga hong, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Judangei le Jentail Juda lei minchang ngei ei nia, male senkhat Crete tuihuol mi le Arabia rama mi ei nia; Hankhoma, Pathien sintho roiinpui ngei an misîr, ei inzirpui chong ang chita ei riet hih!” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Anrêngin a mindona chang riet loiin kamâm aruoi an tia, “Hi ngei hih inmo anni rang?” tiin anni le anni an inrekela.<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Hannirese senkhatin chu iempungei hah, innuinân an manga, “Hi mingei hih uain inrûi kêng an ni!” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pentecost nia Peter chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Hanchu sômleikhat ngei leh Peter hah an indinga, mipui lâia han inringtakin chongril aphuta, “Nangni Judea rama mingei le jerusalema ompu murdi ngei, ko chongril hih rangâi ungla male mahi imo aomzie nangni lei ril rong. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Hi ngei hih nin iem lam angin inrûi mak ngei, atûn hin jîng dâr kuo vaikêng ala ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Hi roi hih Dêipu Joel'n a lei ril hah ani.<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Joel 2:28-32</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> ‘Pathien'n sûn nûka chu hi anghin la tho ki tih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mi murdi chunga ka Ratha la bun ka ta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">nin nâipasal le nin nâinupangngeiin ko chong la misîr an ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nin ruotharte ngeiin inlârna mûng an ta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">male nin tarngeiin ramangin phan an tih.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Ani, ma nikhuo ngeia hanchu ki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">tîrlâmngei nupangngei, pasalngei chunga ka Ratha bun ka ta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">ko chong la misîr an tih.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Chungtieng invâna sininkhêlngei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">male nuoi tieng pilchunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">kamâmruoingei min mu ngei ki tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Mahan thisen, mei, meikhu bit ngei om a ta;<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Nisa jîng a ta male tha thisen anghan sen atih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Pumapa Nikhuo inlal le roiinpuitak hah ajuong tung mân.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Hanchu, tukhomin Pumapa riming ralam murdi chu sanminringin om an tih.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Nangni Israel mingei hi chongngei hih lei rangâi roi! Nangni rengin nin riet anghan, Nazereth Jisua hah Pathien'n nin lâia sininkhêl, kamâmruoi le sinthona ngei nangni a min riet ani. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mk 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Joh 19:18</ref> </char></note> Jisua hah Pathien jêklam le mintuo lam angtakin an sûra, nangnin mi nunsie ngei kuta bângin khrosa jêmdelin nin thata. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mk 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk 24:5</ref> </char></note> Aniatachu Pathien'n thina sinthotheina renga mojôkin, ama hah thinân asûr chien thei loi sikin a kaithoi zoi. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Lap 16:8-11</ref> (LXX)</char></note> David reng khomin a chungroi hi anghin a rila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ka makunga Pumapa ku mu tit ngâia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">kên nîk loina rangin ka changtieng aom tita.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Masikin râisânnân ki sipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ko chong khom râisâna asip.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">ka taksa khomin a sabei ngit ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ka sabeina khom râisânnân asipa.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Masikin ka ratha hi mithi khuoa mâksan no ti nia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Ni mi inthieng ruok mon rang phal no ti ni.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Nangman ringna lampuingei mi ni min mua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">male mi ni ompui sikin râisânnân sip ki tih zoi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Ka champuingei, ei richibul Rêng David roi hah hâitakin nangni ki ril. Ama hah a thi zoia, male an phûma, a thân khom atûnten ei kôla ala om tit. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Lap 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref></char></note>Ama hah Dêipu ania, a ruthûl rangin tumakhat Pathien'n David richisuonpârngei lâia rêngin la phun rangin ânkhâm ngit ti a rieta. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Pathien'n sûnmotona sin a tho rang tie David'n a lei riet piel sikin Khrista inthoinôk rang chong misîrin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Ama hah mithi khuoa mâkrakin om maka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">a ruok khom thâna mon mak,’ ai ti ani.<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Hima Jisua hih Pathien'n thina renga a kaithoinôk zoi ti chong hih keini reng hi rietpuipungei kin ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Pathien changtieng chôiminsâng ani zoia, a Pa kôm renga Ratha Inthieng leikhâm hah a changa, atûna nin mu le nin riet hi ei chunga ajuong vur ani hih. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34,35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref> </char></note>David hah ama lelên invâna kal maka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Pumapa han ku Pumapa kôm:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">ka changtieng insung tit roh.<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>Keima'n na râlngei murdi ne kepha sirna nuoia ka dar mâka a ti, a tina kêng ani.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Hanchu, Jisua nin jêmdelpu hah Pathien'n Pumapa le Khrista aminchang ngêt tih Israel mi murdi riet ngêt rese ngei a tia.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>An chong riet han an mulungrîl atôka, Peter le tîrton dangngei kôm han, “Lâibungngei, imo kin tho rang ani zoi?” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Peter'n an kôm, “Nin sietnangei ngâidam anina rangin insîr ungla, Jisua Khrista rimingin Baptis chang pak roi, hanchu, Pathien manboiapêk Ratha Inthieng hih chang nin tih. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>A khâm hih nangni le nin nâingei le ram lataka mi murdi ngei rang le Pumapa Pathien'n a kôma a koi ngei nâm ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Peter'n Chong dang tamtakin a ril minthâra; male atûnlâi ruolthar saloi ngei renga hih jôk roi, tiin a ngêna. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>A chong a pom ngei murdi baptis an changa, ma nikhuo han mi isâng thum an inbôk sa zoi. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Tîrtonngei kôm inchûn, inlopkhômna inchelin bu khalâi ot inlopkhômna inchelin le chubaitho ningsiet takin an oma.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iempungei lâia ringnun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Tîrtonngei han sininkhêl kamâmruoi tamtak an tho sikin mitinin an rin ngei zoia. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Sin 4:32-35</ref></char></note> A iempungei murdi chu inlopkhômin an neinunngei murdi an minchun zoi. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>An rochonngei an neinunngei murdi juorin an nâng dungjûiin inmang inlômin an insem ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Anîngtin mulung munkhatin Biekina an inkhôm ngâia an in tieng khom râisântak le mulungchuktakin bu khalâi an ot ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Pathien an minpâka, mi murdi râisân lamin an oma. Hanchu, Pumapa minringa hong om tîr ngei chu anîngtin an lôm rangin a hong bôk pe bang ngâi ani.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kholra kutdo mindamin aom zoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Sûnkhat chu Peter le John hah chonûk dâr thumin chubaitho rangin Biekina an sea. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Pasal inkhat a suok renga kholra rojônin Biekina se ngei kôm kutdo rangin mokot, “Enhoi” an ti kôla han anîngtin an dar ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Ama han Peter le John Biekina an lût rang hah a mua, a kut a lei doa, <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Peter le John han an en ngita, Peter'n, “Keini mi hong en ta!” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Masikin, ama han anni renga imakhat man rang sabeiin a en ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Hannirese Peter'n, “Sum le rângkachak dôn mu ung, aniatachu ko dôn nang ke pêk thei chu Nazareth Jisua Khrista rimingin inthoi inla ne ke le lôn roh!” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>A kut changtieng a sûra, a kaithoia, voikhat rengin a kengei le a ke ârtui rungei ahong rât kelena. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Ânchômma a ke leh ândinga a lôn phut zoia, Pathien manpâk pumin Biekina han an lût kelen zoia. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Kea a lôn le Pathien a minpâk hah mingeiin an mua, <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Biekin mokot, “Mokot Enhoi” bula kutdoa lei insung ngâi hah ani ti an rieta, a chunga neinun tung hah kamâmruoi ok an tia, a mindonna chang riet mak ngei.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biekina Peter chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>A dampu han Peter le John hah a la kol tita, hanchu mi murdi'n kamâmruoi tatakin an rieta, Solomon Bokrop an tia han mi tamtak an hong intûpkhôma. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Mipui intûp ngei lâia han Peter'n, Nangni Israel mingei, ithomo hi hih kamâmruoi nin ti? Pathien kin iem mindik sika kin sinthotheinân hi mi hih kin minlôn anga ithomo ni nan en ngit? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Jôk 3:15</ref></char></note>Abraham, Isaac le Jakob Pathien, ei richibulngei Pathien han a Tîrlâm inthieng le roiinpuitak, Jisua hah rachamneipungei kuta nin banga, male nin min sûra, Pilat'n mojôk rang a masat suonûk khomin a makunga nin lei heng ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mk 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Joh 19:12-15</ref></char></note>Mi inthiengtak le diktak hah nin henga, mi thatpa hah mojôk rangin Pilat kôm nin ngêna. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Ringna pêkpu hah nin thata, hannirese Pathien'n ama hah mithingei lâi renga a kaithoi zoia, keini hih a rietpuipungei kin ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>A riming sinthotheina han hih kholrapa hih râtna a pêk ani. Nin mu le nin riet hih a riming taksônna sika sin ani; nin rêngin nin mu angin Jisua taksônna sika hong om hin amindamriem zoi ani.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>Male, “Atûn hin ka champuingei, nangni le nin ruoipungei khomin Jisua chunga nin sintho hah nin riet loi tatak ani ti ki riet zoi ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Pathien'n dêipungei murdi manga Khrista han a tuong rang ani tia a lei ril hah a juongtung ani zoi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Masikin nin sietnangei nangni ngâidam theina rangin insîr ungla, Pathien tieng hong kîrnôk ta roi, hanchu nin sietnangei ngâidamin om nin ta. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Male Pumapa kôm renga rathatienga râtna zora juong tung a ta, nin ranga Messiah a lei thang Jisua hah, juongtîr a tih. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Pathien'n tienlâia a dêipu inthiengngei bâia a lei phuong sai anghan neinunngei murdi sin minthar zora atung mâka chu invâna la om rang ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bal 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Moses khom han, ‘Pumapa nin Pathien'n keima ni tîr anga nin sûngsuokngei lâia mi dêipu inkhat nangni minding pe a ta; nin kôma a ril murdi chu nin jôm rang ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Bal 18:19</ref></char></note> Tukhom ha dêipu chongjôm loi murdi chu, Pathien mingei renga sensâiin that minmang pai nîng a tih,’ a ti ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Male Samuel le a nûka dêipungei murdi chu atûnlâi thurchi hih an lei misîr ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Aph 22:18</ref></char></note>Pathien'n a dêipungei manga chong a lei khâm hah nangni ngei rang ania, nin richibulngei kôma chongkhâm a lei pêk hah khom nin mansa zoia, Pathien'n Abraham kôm, ‘Ni richisuonpârngei sikin pilchunga mi murdi satvur ki tih, a lei ti anghan.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Masikin Pathien'n a Tîrlâm hah a thanga, nin puoloina lampuingei nûksong zit rang le mi murdi sat nangni vur rangin nin kôm a juongtîr masa ani hi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Roijêkpungei makunga Peter le John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Hanchu Peter le John'n mipuingei kôm chong an ril lâihan ochaingei kôm, Biekin enkol ulienngei, Sadduceengei hah an kôm an juong tung zuta. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Jisua thina renga ânthoinôk sikin miriemngei khom inthoinôk an tih, ti thurchi mingei an ril ngei sikin asân an taksia. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Masikin, an sûr ngeia, kholoi ani sikin anangtûk tena rangin intâng ina an khum ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Hannirese, an chongril rangâipungei lâia mi tamtakin an iem zoia, an tamlam chu pasal ulien korong khom isâng rangnga dôr an ni.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Anangtûka chu Juda ruoipungei, Upangei, Balam minchupungei Jerusalema an intûp zoia. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Ochai Inlaltak Annas, Caiaphas, John, Alexander ngei le Ochai Inlaltak rûia mingei murdi lehan. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Peter le John hah an makunga an minding ngeia, “I angin mo mahi nin tho? I ranakin mo, tu riming mo nin mang tiin an rekel ngeia?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Peter hah Ratha Inthiengin a sipa, an kôm, “Mipui Ruoipungei le Upangei: <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Avien hin kholrapa chunga sin sa roia le a hong damna roia, i anga mindam mo tiin mi nin rekela anînchu, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Nin rêngin riet roi, Israelngei murdi khomin riet rese ngei, Nazareth Jisua Khrista khrosa nin jêmdela, Pathien'n thina renga a kaithoinôk rimingin hi kholrapa nin makunga dam vangin ânding ani hi. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Lap 118:22</ref></char></note>Jisua hih ani, Pathien lekhabua ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Nangni in sinpungeiin nin hengpai lung hah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">akila lung kâmnâng tak ahong chang zoi.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Sanminringna hih Jisua kôm mangke aom, rammuol pumpuia tute kôm mi min ringtheina rang riming dang Pathien'n pêk mak,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Peter le John ngei an hâi tie an mua, lekha theiloi minmôl papai anni an rieta, asân kamâm aom an tia, Jisua kôm om ngâi an ni tiin an riet sikin. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Hannirese, an mi mindam hah an kôm Peter le John inding an enin ite dem rang lâk om maka. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Masikin roijêkna in renga an mojôk ngei zoia, an se nûkin chu an thenin anin kerenga. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>“Hi mingei hih inmo ei tho rang ani zoi? an sininkhêl tho hih jerusalema om murdi khomin an riet zoia, eini khomin ite ei dem theiloi hih. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Aniatachu mîn an riet minzar uol loina rangin tute kôm Jisua riminga chongril nôk khâiloi rangin lei misi ngei rei u,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Masikin, anni hah an koi ngei nôka Jisua rimingin chongril tet khâiloi rangin le minchu ngei khâiloi rangin chong an pêk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Hannirese, Peter le John'n an kôm, “Pathien mitmua, Pathien chongjôm nêkin nangni chong jôm mo adik uol mindon ta u. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Keini chu kin mu le kin riet hi misîr loiin om thei no ni-ung” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Hanchu roijêkpungei han an masî ngei nôk uola an mojôk ngei zoi, Peter le John sintho sika han mi murdi'n Pathien an minpâk sikin dûkmintong ngei thei khâimak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Kamâmomtaka an mindampu hah kum sômminli nêka ulien ani.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iempungeiin hâina an zong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Peter le John hah an mojôk ngei suole han, an champuingei kôm an kîr nôka, ochai inlalngei le upangeiin an kôma an ti ngei hah an ril leta. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Jôk 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Lap 146:6</ref></char></note>Iempungei maha an riet lehan anrêngin Pathien kôm chubaithôn, “Pumapa Ânchungtak nangma, invân, pilchung, tuikhanglien le an sûnga neinun om murdi ngei Sinpu ni ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Lap 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Nangman Ratha inthiengin kin richibulngei ni tîrlâm David bâiin hi chong hi ni min rila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Jentailngei ithomo an ning a thika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">mipuingeiin ithomo neinun kâmnângloi an mintuo?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Pilchung rêngngeiin an insiema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">roijêkpungei khom an intûpkhôma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Pumapa le a Messiah doi rangin tiin.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luk 23:7-11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Joh 18:28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref></char>
    </note>Ma ang han Herod le Pontius Pilat'n, hi khopuilien hin Jentailngei le Israelngei leh an intûpkhôma, Jisua ni Tîrlâm inthieng Messiah doi rangin. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Ni sinthotheina le nu lungdo mintung ranga ne jêk masat sai anghan neinuntin tho rangin an intûp zoi. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Misinangei hih en ta ni tîrlâmngei hih hâina murdi leh nu thurchi misîr phalna pêk roh. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Mingei mindamna rangin nu kut phar inla, male tîrlâm inthieng Jisua riming jârin kamâmruoingei le sininkhêlngei sin theina rangin ni pêk roh” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Chubai an tho suole chu an om khômna mun hah ahong innîka, anrêngin Ratha Inthiengin an sipa, hâitakin Pathien chong an ril phut zoi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iempungei neinuntin an insem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">Sin 2:44</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:45">45</ref></char>
    </note> Iempungei pâl hah mulung munkhat le mulungbôk mulungrîl munkhat ruputin an oma, an lâia tukhomin an neinun dôn ngei hah keima kata kêng ti loiin, neinuntin insemin an inlopkhôm ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Tîrtonngei han asân sinthona dônin Pumapa Jisua inthoinôkna, rietpuipu nina rangin chong an ril ngâia, male anrêngin Pathien satvurna lientak an chang pak zoi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>An pâla tute ânsam khom om mak ngei, loingei mini, inngei mini an juora, aman hah an hong chôia, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>male tîrtonngei kuta an pêka; an nâng lam angtakin sum hah an sem ngâia.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Masikin, Joseph, tîrtonngeiin Barnabas an ti (Aomtie chu “mohôk ngâipu” tina ani), Levi jâisuon Cyprus tuihuola mi ania, <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>loimun a dôn hah a juora, aman hah hong chôiin tîrtonngei kuta a hong pêk zoi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ananias le Sapphira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Hannisenla mi inkhat a riming Ananias a dôngma Sapphira leh an oma, an neinun senkhat a juora. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Hannirese ma sum hah a dôngma inrietpuiin in-ang a thupa, adang aminieng kai hah tîrtonngei kuta an hong pêka. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Hanchu Peter'n, “Ananias Ratha Inthieng huongin ram man in-angrip thup rangin ithomo Soitan'n nu mulungrîla racham ni min nei? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Nu juor mâna han khom nata ania; nu juor suo nûkin khom aman chu nata ania, ithomo ma anga neinun tho rangin nu mulunga na masata? Miriemngei huong nimak chea, Pathien huong kêng ni ni,” a tipea. <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Ananias'n ma chong hah a riet lehan, ha renghan an leta a thi kelena; hanchu ha thurchi a riet murdi'n chu asân an chi zoia. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Ruothartengei an honga, a ruok hah an thoma, an rojôna, male an phûm zoi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Dâr inthum vêl suole a dôngma khom ite roi riet loiin a hong lûta. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Peter'n amanu kôm, “Na pasal le neinun man nin man hah hi dôr veihi mo ani, ni ril roh?” tiin a rekela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">“O, ma dôr vai hih ani,” tiin amanu han a thuona.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Masikin Peter'n amanu kôm han, “Ithomo Pumapa Ratha minsinna rangin no lômpa le nin inruol? En ta atûn hin na lômpa phûm ngei khom mokota an hong tung nôk zoi so, male nangma khom nang rojôn nôk an tih,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Hanchu voikhat rengin Peter ke kunga han ân leta a thi kelena. Ruothartengei hah an hong lûta, amanu hah a thîn an hong mua, masikin an rojôn paia, a pasal kôla han an phûmsa zoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Koiindang mi murdi ngei le midangngei ha roi a riet murdi'n chu asân an chi sabak zoi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sininkhêl le kamâmruoingei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Tîrtonngei chu mipui lâia kamâmruoingei le sininkhêl tamtak an tho tira. Iempungei anrêngin Solomon Bokropa an intûpkhôm ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>An pâl pêntieng mingei hah tute an kôma kop ngam khâimak ngeia, nikhomsenla mingeiin anni ngei hah an minpâk ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Hannirese Pumapa iempungei pasal le nupang tamtakin an pâla kopin an hong pung bang ani. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Tîrtonngei sintho sika han, damloingei khom khalâidung lamlienngeia an hong rojôna, jâlmunngeia, puonphângeia an min jâl ngeia, Peter hong inlôi zorân a rilîm tete luon mi minli thei duoi mo, an tia. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Jerusalem kôl revêla khopuingei renga mipuingei an honga, damloingei, ramkhori sûrngei an hong tuonga; anrêngin an dam let zoi.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tîrtonngei dûk an mintong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Hanchu ochai Inlaltak le a champui Sadduceengei murdi an honga, tîrtonngei hah an narsa ngei tataka, dûkmintong ngei rang an masata. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Tîrtonngei hah an sûr ngeia intâng ina an khum ngei zoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Hannirese, jâna Pumapa vântîrton inkhatin intâng in mokot hah ajuong mo-onga, pêntieng a tuong ngeia male an kôm, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Se ungla Biekina vân ding ungla, male mipuingei kôm hi ringna thar roi hih varil roi,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Ma chong hah an jôma, male an sea, khuovârchak dôrin Pathien Biekina an lûta, mi an minchu phut zoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Hanchu Ochai Inlaltak le a champuingei hah an honga, Juda ulienngei murdi hah roijêkna lientak nei rangin an koi bûma; an makunga rangin tîrtonngei varuoi rangin intâng ina mi an tîra. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Aniatachu, ulienngei hah an vatungin chu intâng ina han tîrtonngei hah tute va mu khâi mak ngeia, masikin an hong kîr nôka, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>“Intâng in ha asadimin inkhârin a rungpungei mokotngeia indingin kin va mua; hannirese kin mo onga asûnga tute mu mak me,” tiin an hong rila. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Biekina ochaisi le ruoipu ulien han ha chong hah an rietin chu, “Tîrtonngei chunga imo atung ani zoi hih,” tiin an kamâm sabak zoia. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Hanchu mi inkhat a honga, an kôm, “Rangâita u! Intâng ina mi nin khum ngei han Biekina mi an minchu ngei bang so,” tiin a hong rila. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Hanchu ruoipu ulien hah a champuingei le an honga tîrtonngei hah rangrât song loiin an hong ruoi ngeia, rangrât an songin chu mipuingeiin lungin me deng ni ngei ti an chi sikin.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Tîrtonngei asûnga an hong tuonga male roijêkna muna an inding ngeia, male Ochai Inlaltak han chong a rakel ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27:25</ref></char></note>“Hi mi riminga hin minchu tet khâi loi rangin chong inngartak nangni kin pêka, aniatachu en ta u nin chongrilin Jerusalem nin min sipzit zoi hi! hi mi thina hih keini ngei mi minpêl rang nin bôk ani hih!” tiin a ti pe ngeia.<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Peter le tîrton dangngei han, “Miriemngei chong nêkin Pathien chong kin jôm ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Nangnin Khrosa peret leh nin jêmdela nin that Jisua hah ei richibulngei Pathien'n a kaithoi nôk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Israelngei nunsie minsîr ngeia ngâidam an chang theina rangin Ama ngêt hah Pathien'n Ruoipu le Sanminringpu ni rangin a changtienga rangin a kaithoi zoia. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Keini hih ha roi rietpuipungei kin nia, Keini le Ratha Inthieng, Pathien'n chong jôm ngei kai kôma a pêk ngâi hah kin ni sa,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Hanchu roijêkpungei han ma chong ha an rietin chu asân an ning athika, tîrtonngei hah thatpai rang an bôka. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Hannirese an lâia Pharisee inkhat a riming Gamaliel, Balam minchupu le mitinin mirit an tho ngâi hah Roijêkna han ândinga. Tîrtonngei hah pêntieng chomolte mojôk rangin chong a pêka, <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>hanchu roijêkpungei makunga han, “Ki Israel champuingei, hi mingei chunga tho ranga nin bôk chunga hin indîn roi. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Moton han khom Theudas, ‘Milien ki ni’ tiin a hong oma, mi raza minli dôr an jûi ti nin la riet, nikhomrese ama hah thatin a oma, a nûk jûipungei khom anrêngin chekaninchâi zita ite ni khâimak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Ma suonûk khom han, intelna zora lâiin Galilee rama om Judas hah a hong om nôka; a tieng mi tamtak an kop nôka, aniatachu, ama khom thatin a om nôka a nûk jûipungei murdi khom chekaninchâi zit nôka. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Masikin ma roia hin nangni ki ti, hi mingei hih tôn ngei no roi, omchien rese ngei! tho ranga an bôk le an sintho ngei hih miriem renga ânzir anînchu mong nôk kelen atih, <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>hannirese Pathien renga an tho anînchu mene no tunui, Pathien doi kêng nin hong changna rang!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Roijêkna han Gamaliel chong hah an poma. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Tîrtonngei hah asûnga an koi ngeia, an vîk ngeia, Jisua rimingin thurchi misîr tet khâiloi rangin chong an pêk ngeia, male an mojôk ngei zoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Hanchu, roijêkpungei lâi renga an jôka Jisua riming sika tuong thei rangin intelin an om sikin asân an râiasâna. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Male anîngtin Biekin le insûng ngeia thurchisa misîrin, Jisua chu Messiah ani tiin an misîr bang ngâi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sanpu sari ngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ma zora han, ruoisingei an hong pung bang lâia han, anîngtin an neinun sema han meithâingei rang lunghâng an tho ngâiloi sikin Greek chong mang Judangei hah, Juda Hebrew ngei chunga an chiera. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Masikin, tîrton sômleinik ngei han iempungei murdi an koibum zita, “Pathien chongril mâksanin anîngtin sum puon jêk kin changin chu dik noni. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Masikin, champuingei nin lâia mi Ratha Inthienga asip le vârna dôn pasal sari inthang ungla, an kôm hi sin hih minkol kin tih, <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Keini chu chubaitho le chongrilin om kin tih,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Tîrtonngei chong han mipuingei murdi an râiasâna, masikin Stephan taksôn dettak le Ratha Inthienga sip le Philip, Prochoras, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas le Nikolas Jentail Juda lei chang Antioch mi an thang suok ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Ma mi sari ngei hah tîrtonngei makunga an minding ngeia, tîrtonngei han an lu chunga kut min ngamin chubai an thoa.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Masikin Pathien thurchi inzarin a oma, Jerusalema ruoisingei asân an hong punga, ochai lâia mi tamtak khomin taksônna hah an pomsa zoi.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stephan an sûr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Stephan chu Pathien satvurna tamtak changin le sinthotheinân a sipa, mipui lâia kamâmruoi le sininkhêl roiinpuitak a tho ngena. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Hannirese Cyrene khuo le Alexandria khuo renga Juda senkhat (suok renga jôk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">suok renga jôk: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahi Judangei suoka om ngei, aniatachu rochôkin aninônchu zalena jôkin an om zoi.</char></note>) Synagog an tia kop sa ngâi ngei le Cilicia ram le Asia rama Judangei an honga, Stephan an hôn khalpuia. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Aniatachu Ratha han ma anga vârna a pêka han a hong chongin chu makhal mindok thei ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Hanchu, “Moses le Pathien a rilminsiet kin riet,” min ti rangin mi senkhat sum le an methêmin an lei dara. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Ma anghan, mipuingei, Upangei le Balam minchupungei an misieta. Stephan hah an minsûra, Judangei roijêkna an tuonga. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Mi senkhat a chungroia milak tho rangin an hong tuonga anni han, “Hi mi, hin kin Biekin Inthieng le Moses Balam a rilminsiet bang ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Nazereth Jisua'n, hi Biekin hih set a ta, Moses'n balam mi pêk ngei hah thûl atih, tiin a misîr kin riet!” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Roijêkna muna om murdi'n Stephan hah an enruma, a mâi hah vântîrton mêl angin an mu zoi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Stephan chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Ochai Inlaltak han Stephan kôm, “hi chong hi adik mo?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2,3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1">Aph 12:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Stephan'n, “Ka lâibungngei ka pangei rangâi roi, ei richibul Abraham hah Haran khuoa ava om mân, Mesopotamia rama aom lâihan, roiinpuina Pathien hah a kôm ânlâra. <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>‘Na ram le ni insûngmingei mâksan inla, ram nang ka la min mûna rang tieng se roh,’ a tipea. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Aph 11:31</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Aph 12:4</ref></char></note>Masikin, a ram renga ânphêta, Harana om rangin a sea. Abraham a pa thi suole, ha mun renga atûna nin omna rama hin Pathien'n nangni a min thon ani. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aph 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> Pathien'n ite mun luorang, a ke sirna rang dôr luo pêk maka, aniatachu ama le anûka a richisuonpârngei tena pêk rangin ânkhâm ani. Pathien'n ha chong ânkhâm lâihan Abraham chu nâi la dôn mak. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6,7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Aph 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref></char></note>Pathien'n hi anghin a tia, ‘Nin richisuonpârngei chu mi rama khuolmi la nîng an ta, kum raza minli mi suoka omin asân dûkmintong la nîng an tih. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Jôk 3:12</ref></char></note>Hannirese suoka tuong rang mingei chu keiman jêk ka ta; masuole jôk an tih, hi muna hin ni la biek an tih,’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Aph 17:10-14</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Aph 21:2-4</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Aph 25:26</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31-35:18">Aph 29:31—35:18</ref></char></note>Pathien'n Abraham kôm chonginkhitin an sertan rangin chong a pêk zoi. Masikin Abraham han a nâipasal Isaac hah sûn sari suoleh a ser a tanpea; Isaac'n a nâi Jakob a tanpe nôka, Jakob'n a nâi sômleinik ei richibulngei inthang ngei a tanpe nôka.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Aph 37:11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Aph 37:28</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:2">Aph 39:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char>
    </note> “Jakob nâipasalngeiin an lâibungpa Joseph hah an narsa zoia, Egypt rama suok rangin an juora, hannirese, Pathien'n a ompuia. <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Aph 41:39-41</ref> </char></note>Intak a tuongna murdia a san minjôka, Egypt rama Rêng Pharoah mitmua mi vârtak le midit omtak a min nia; Pharaoh han Egypt ram le a ina mi murdi chunga râiôt ni rangin a min changa. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1">Aph 42:1</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 42:2">2</ref></char></note>Hanchu Egypt le Canaan ram pumpuia mâitâm achula, asân intak an tuonga, ei richibulngei han sâk le nêk rang reng man khâimak ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Jakob'n Egypt rama bu aom ti a rietin chu a nâingei a tîra, ma hah an se phutna tak alei ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Aph 45:1</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:16">Aph 45:16</ref></char></note>Avoinikna an se han Joseph han a lâibungngei le inrietna a lei thopui ngeia, Egypt Rêng han khom Joseph insungmingei a lei riet zoia. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9">Aph 45:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">Aph 46:27</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Hanchu, Joseph han a pa Jakob le a insûngmingei murdi Egypt rama om rangin a koia, an rêngin sômsari-leirangnga anni. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Aph 46:1-7</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:33">Aph 49:33</ref></char></note> Hanchu Jakob hah Egypt rama a va sea ha muna han ama le a nâipasalngei chu an thi zoia. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Aph 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref></char></note>A ruok hah Shechem khuo an hong chôia, Hamor rûingei renga Abraham'n suma a rochôk thâna han an phûm zoi.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17,18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Jôk 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>“Abraham kôma Pathien chongkhâm ahongtung rang zora ahong nâi tena ha mingei hah Egypt rama an hong pung zoia. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Anûktaka Egypt rama han rêng dang Joseph riet loi ahong inlal zoia. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10">Jôk 1:10</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:11">11</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Jôk 1:22</ref></char></note>Ama han ei richibulngei hah a huong ngeia, dûk amintong ngeia, nâitesenngei ring loina rangin an suok suo pêntieng pai rangin rangrâtin chong a pêka. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Jôk 2:2</ref></char></note>Ma zora tak han Moses ajuon zira nâitesen mêl satak a nia. A pa ina thân thum an donsuia, <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Jôk 2:3-10</ref></char></note> an in renga an pai suo nûkin, Pharaoh nâinupangin a lâka a nâipasal rangin a vâia. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Moses hah Egypt rama vârna murdi an minchua, hanchu chongril theitak le sinthothei tak a hongni zoi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Jôk 2:11-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Kum sômminli a hong nînchu, a mulung sûnga a sungsuok Israel champuingei kho angin mo an om mu rang nuomin ava pana. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>A va sên chu mi inkhat Egypt min dûk amintong lâi ava mua, masikin a sanna, dûktongpu chunga han phûba a laka Egypt mipa hah a thata. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>(Moses han, ama mangin Pathien'n a mingei mojôk atih ti a sungsuok ngeiin an riet mini tiin a bôka hannirese riet mak ngei.) <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Anangtûka chu Isreal mi inik insuol lâitak ava tonga ava sel ngeia, ‘Rangâita u sûngsuokngei,’ lâibungrêng kêng nin ni, ithomo hima anga nin insuola? tiin min sûk ngei rang a bôka. <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>A theiloi uolpu han Moses hah a nampaia, ‘Kin chunga ruoipu le roijêkpu rangin tumo nang phun?’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>‘Majâna Egypt mi na that angdên han ni that nôk rang no bôk mo?’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3">Jôk 18:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 18:4">4</ref></char></note>Ma chong hah a riet lehan, Moses a rota, Midian rama ava oma, mahan nâipasal inik a neia.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Jôk 3:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Kum sômminli avun suole chu, Sinai Muol ramchâr kôla chîmbuk akângna han vântîrton a kôm ânlâra. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Moses'n a neinun mu hah a kamâm tataka, minthâr rang bôkin a va nâia, Pumapa rôl a rieta: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‘Keima hih ni richibulngei Pathien, Abraham Pathien Isaac Pathien, Jakob Pathien hah ki ni,’ a lei tia, Moses hah ichîn ânnîka en ngam khâi maka. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Pumapa'n, a kôm, ‘Ne kekokngei ha khek roh, nên dingna mun hah mun inthieng kêng. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Egypt rama ki mi omngei dengthei tie ku mua, an inrûmnangei khom ki rieta anni ngei minjôk rangin ku juong ani. Hong ta; Egypt rama nang lei tîr rong,’ a tia.<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Jôk 2:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ha Moses kôma ruoipu le roijêkpu rangin tumo nang phun? tia an makhal hah chîmbuk kângna taka vântîrton a kôma inlâr han a sanna, Pathien'n ama lele hah ruoipu le sanminjôkpu ni rangin ai tîr ani. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Jôk 7:3</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Jôk 14:21</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:33">Tel 14:33</ref></char></note>Ama han anni hah a ruoisuoka Egypt rama, tuipui sena, ramchâra kum sômminli sûng han Kamânruoi le sininkhêl tamtak thôn a ruoi ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bal 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> </char></note>Moses hah Israel mingei kôm, ‘Pathien'n keima, mi tîr angin nin sûngsuokngei lâia om dêipu nangni la minchang pe atih,’ tipu hah ani. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Jôk 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Bal 5:1-33</ref></char></note>Ama hah ani ramchâra Israel mi intûp ngei lâia oma; ei richibulngei kôma le Sinai muola a chongpuipu vântîrton kôma, eini mi pêk ranga Pathien chong ring lâkpu hah ani.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>“Hannirese ei richibulngei han a chong jôm nuom mak ngeia; ama hah an nampaia male Egypt ram tieng kîr nôk an nuoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Jôk 32:1</ref></char></note>Masikin <char style="w">Aaron</char> kôm, ‘Kin moton ruoipu rangin pathienngei mi sin pe roh. Moses Egypt ram renga mi ruoipu laka a thurchi reng riet khâi mak meh,’ an tia. <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Jôk 32:2-6</ref> </char></note> Masuole chu, ma ngei han serât chalte rimil an sina, a rimil hah sa thatin an bieka, male an kut suoka han mirit thonân ruolhoi an thoa an râi an minsâna. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42,43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amos 5:25-27</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Hanchu, Pathien'n anni hah nûk a song ngeia, invâna ârsingei an biek theina rangin a rotsan ngeia, dêipu lekhabua:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Israel insung mingei!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">kum sômminli sûngin ramchâra han</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">inbôlna sa thatin nin pêk ngâi hah keima ni mu ung.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Molech pathien puon-in nin chôia nin pathien</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">le Rephan nin ârsi pathien;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">rimilngei hah chubaimûk rangin nin sin ngei hah an ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Masikin Babylon khêl tieng nangni min tâng ki tih, tia ânziek anghan.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Jôk 25:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char>
    </note> “Ramchâra han ei richibulngeiin Pathien omna Puon-in an neia, ma in hah Pathien'n Moses kôm sin rangin a bea, a rimil a min mu lam taka sin ani. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3:14-17</ref></char></note>Ha ngei hah ei richibulngei khomin an hong dôn banga, Pathien'n ei richibulngei motona ai not pai nâmngei rama an luo lâihan Joshua lût zorân an lûtpui ani. David a zora tena a oma. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Rich 17:1-14</ref></char></note>Ha David hah Pathien mitmua miditin a hong oma, Jacob Pathien ta ranga omna rang sin pe rangin a zonga. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Rêng 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Rich 3:1-17</ref> </char></note>Hannirese, in hah chu Solomon'n kêng a sin pe zoi.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>“Nikhomrese, Ânchungtak Pathien chu kuta sin in ngeia om ngâi mak; Dêipu'n,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49,50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>‘Pumapa'n, invân ke Rêngsukmun ania pilchung ke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ke sirna ani. I anga in mo mi ni sin pe rang?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Khotieng mo kên ngamna rang mun khom aom?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Hi neinun murdi hih keima ki sin nimak mo?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Khodôra mulung ngar mo nin ni! Mulungrîl le kuor in-ongloi sertanloingei anga, nin richibulngei tho ngâi lam angin Ratha Inthieng nin dem tita! <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nin richibulngeiin, dêipungei lâia tumo dûkmintong loia an dar? midik tak juong rang lei juong ril Pathien tîrtonngei hah an thata, atûn nangni hih mi min sûrpu le a thatpu nin ni hi. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Nangni hi Pathien balam, vântîrtonngeiin an juong thak muchaka jômloi ngei nin ni!” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stephan lung leh an dêngthatna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Roijêkpungei han Stephan chong hah an rietin chu an takasia, a chunga an rakam an tâta. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Hannirese, Stephan hah Ratha Inthienga sip ania, invân tieng a en ngita, Pathien roiinpuina le a changtienga Jisua inding a mua. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>“En ta u! invân in-ong ku mua, Pathien changtienga Miriem Nâipasal inding ku mu!” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Hanchu, roijêkpungei han inringtakin an inieka, an kutngei leh an kuorngei an hîpa. Hanchu ha renghan a tieng an tâna. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Khopuilien sûng renga an mojôk paia, lungin an dênga rietpuipungei han ruotharte inkhat a riming Sual an tih kôm han an puon an mâka. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Lungin an dêng lâiin Stephan'n Pumapa a koia, “Pumapa Jisua ka Ratha lâk ta roh,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Khûk ânbila, rôl inringtakin ânieka, “Pumapa! hi an sietna hih riet pe ngei khâi no roh!” a tia. Ha chongbâi hah a ti suole chu a thi zoi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Male Saul khomin Stephan thi hah apompui sa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saul'n koiindangngei dûk a mintong</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ma nikhuo renga han Jerusalema koiindangngei hah dûk an mintong ngei kelen zoia. Hanchu tîrtonngei telloi iempu adang nâm chu Judea le Samaria ram khuotina chek an inchâi zita. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Pathien sabei senkhatin Stephan ruok hah an phûma, mulungna takin an châ zoi.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4">Sin 22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Sual chu koiindang minboipai rang bôkin in tina a lûta, iempungei nupang, pasal a kaisuo ngeia intâng ina a khum ngei zoi.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria rama thurchisa rila aom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Iempu khuotina chekinchâi ngei hah muntina an sea, thurchisa an ril tira. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Philip chu Samari khopuilien a lûta, an kôm Khrista thurchi a rila. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Mipuingeiin Philip chongril an rieta, sininkhêl a tho ngei an mûn chu a chongril ngei hah asân an rangâia. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Ramkhoringei hah inringtakin in-iekin mi tamtak sûng renga an hong jôka, phalkhatthi le kholra tamtak khom a mindam ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Ha khuo mingei hah an râisân tataka.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Ma khopui han mi inkhat a riming Simon, dôithei a oma, mi inlal takin an bea, Samari mingei han a dôi hah an kamâm tataka. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Khopuilien sûnga mi murdi, achîn alienin a chong asân an rangâia, “Hi mi hih Pathien sinthotheina roiinpui an ti hah ani,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>A mitphildôi hah zora sôttak kamâm tataka an lei ti zoi sikin a chong kamâm omtak hah an rangâi ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Aniatachu Pathien Rêngram thurchisa le Jisua Khrista riming Philip'n a ril hah an iem le chu nupang, pasalin baptisma an changa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simon khomin a iema; baptisma a chang zoia, Philip kôm han aom bang ngâia, sininkhêl kamâmruoi a sinngei hah a mua kamâm aom sabak a tia.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Jerusalema tîrton omngei han Samari khuoa omngei chu Pathien chong an pom zoi tih an rieta Peter le John an kôm an tîra. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Anni hah an tungin chu a iempu thar ngeiin Ratha Inthieng an chang theina rangin chubai an thope ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>An lâia tute chunga khom Ratha Inthieng la chum mak; Pumapa Jisua riminga baptisma an chang vai kêng ala ni. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Hanchu Peter le John'n an lu chunga kut an minngama, male Ratha Inthieng an chang zoi.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Tîrtonngei han iempungei chunga kut an min ngamin Ratha Inthieng pêk an ni ti, Simon han amûn chu, Peter le John hah sum a pêk ngeia, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>“Hi anga sinthotheina hi mi pêk roi, tu chunga khom ku kut ki minngamna chita Ratha Inthieng an chang theina rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Hannisenla, Peter'n a kôm han, “Nangma le nu sum hih meidîla se rese, Pathien manboipêk suma rochôk rang no bôk sikin! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Kin sinna hin kopna le rangtum dôn mak che, nu mulungrîl Pathien mitmûn adikloi sikin. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Masikin, hih no bôkna saloi renga hi insîr inla Pumapa kôm invûi roh, ni mindon hih nang ala ngâidam theina rangin. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mulungrîl bôkna khâtak ne pêla, sietnân nang a khitrap iti nang ki riet,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simon'n Peter le John kôm, “Nin ti ngei hi inkhat luo ku chunga atung loina rangin nangnin rangâihoitak Pumapa kôm chubai mi thope roi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Peter le John'n an thurchi le Pumapa thurchi an misîr zoiin chu Jerusalema an kîr nôka, lampuia Samari rama khuo tamtaka Thurchi Sa an misîra.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philip le Ethopia milien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Pumapa tîr vântîrtonin Philip hah a chongpuia, “Inthok inla, Jerusalem renga Gaza panna lampuia saktieng ramchâr pielna han se roh,” a tia. (Atûn hin chu hi lampui hih mang nikhâi mak.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27-28"/>Masikin Philip ânthoka a sea. Ethopia rama mi inkhat an Rêngnu nuoia sinpêl milien inlaltak a sum murdi enkolpu, Jerusalema Pathien chubaimûk rangin a sea. A kîr nôk tieng chu tali chunga chuongin dêipu Isaiah lekhabu a porea. <verse eid="ACT 8:27-28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Ratha'n Philip kôm, “Tali so va pan inla vanâi roh,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Hanchu Philip a tâna, dêipu Isaiah lekhabu a pore hah a rieta, no pore hah ni rietthei mo? tiin a rekela.<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>“Ama'n tutên mi rilminthâr pe loiin i angin mo ki riet thei ranga?” tiin a thuona. Hanchu Philip ha tali chunga a kala a kôla insungpui rangin a koia. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32,33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Pathien lekhabu a pore hah ma hi ani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Belri that rang angin belri angin ama hah an tuonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Belrite a mul eplâitak khomin a dâirek angin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Chongbai khat luo ti maka.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Ântem lâiin a roijêkna hah lâkpe'n a oma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">A richisuonpârngei thurchi tûn mo ril ta nih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Rammuol renga a ringna ahek zoi sikin,” ti hi.<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Milien han Philip kôm han, “Ni ril ta, dêipu hin tu thurchi mo a misîr? Ama thurchi mo, midang thurchi mo?” tiin a rekela. <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Hanchu Philip'n, hi Pathien lekhabua phutin Jisua Khrista Thurchi sa a rila. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>An sea suk an chumin chu, tui omna an tunga, milien han “mahin tui aom, baptis ka chang loina rangin imo mikhap?” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Philip'n a kôm, “Nu mulungrîl murdi'n ni iemin chu na chang thei,” a tia. Ama han, “Ki iem,” Jisua Khrista chu Pathien nâi ani ti ki iem, tiin a thuona.<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Hanchu, tali ha an min ngama, an chuma Philip le milien hah tuia an juong sea. Philip'n Ethopia milien hah baptis a min changa. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Tui renga an hong jôka, Pumapa Ratha Inthiengin Philip hah a lâk min manga, ama hah mu khâi maka, hankhom râisântakin a in tieng a sea. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Philip chu mingeiin Azotus khuoa an mu nôka, hanchu a sea, Caesarea khuo a tung mâka chu khopui murdia Thurchi Sa a misîr tira.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Saul inthûlna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Sin 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Saul han Pumapa jûipungei hah en nuom ngei maka, anrêngin that let rang aphuta. Hanchu Ochai Inlalngei kôm a sea. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Damascusa Khuoa Synagog mingei kôma pêk rang lekha a min mizieka, ma khuo han a nuom lam takin sin a thothei tiin an lei rietna rang ani, tukhom Pumapa jûi mi amûn chu nupang mo, pasal mo, a sûra Jerusalema a hongtuong theina rangin.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Hanchu, Saul hah Damascusa a tung rangtôn, inningloi rengin invân renga vârin ajuong êla. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>pila ânlet paia, rôl miring a rieta, “Saul, Saul! ithomo ma angtaka dûk mini tho hih?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Hanchu, Saul han, “Pumapa tumo ni ni?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Hanchu, rôl miring han, “Keima Jisua, dûk ni mintong bângpu hah ki ni.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>“Nikhomrese, inthoi inla khopuilien sûnga va senla, mahan ni sintho rang nang lei ril an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Saul leh munkhata se ngei chu, chong theiloi le a mindona chang riet loiin, an inding chiena, rôl miring hah chu an rieta, aniatachu tute mu mak ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Saul hah nuoi renga ânthoia male a mitngei ahong menga, hannirese, tute muthei khâi maka, a kuta an kaia Damascusa khuo tieng an sepuia. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Sûnthum dôr chu khoite muthei loi le sâk nêk khom sâk thei loiin a oma.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Ma zora han Damascusa khuoa Khristien iempu mi inkhat a riming Ananias a oma. Inlârnân Pumapa a mua, “Ananias!” a tia,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Ananias'n, “Pumapa hin ko om,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Pumapa han a kôm, “Ananias insiem inla, Lamlien Tûn son va sênla, Judas ina Tarsus mi a riming Sual an ti hah va rok roh, ama'n chubai a tho tit. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Male inlârnân mi inkhat a riming Ananias a sea, a mitngei minvâr pe rangin a lu chunga a kutngei minngamin chubaitho pe rangin nang a lei mu zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ananias'n, “Pumapa ma miriem han Jerusalema khuo mingei dûk amintong lam mi tamtak ngeiin min rila. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Male atûnhin khom Damascusa khuoa nang jûipungei, sûrna rang phalna lekha ochaisingei kôm renga a dôn,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Pumapa han, “va se roh, ama hah ki sinthopu rangin ka thang zoi, hi Jentailngei, Rêngngei le Israel mingei ki riming min riet ranga ki tîr rang ani. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Keima sikin idôrmo dûk a la tong rang nang la ril ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Masikin Ananias hah a sea, Saul omna ina a lûta, male Saul chunga a kutngei a minngama “Sungsuok Saul ni mit vâr nôkna rang le Ratha Inthieng sipa no om theina rangin no hongna lampuia na kôma inlârpu Pumapa Jisua'n ni hongtîr ani,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Harenghan, a mitngei renga ngalip angati ajuong tâka, a mitngei ahong vârpe nôka. Hanchu ânthoia baptis a changa; <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Male bu, an, a nêka a hong har nôk zoi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Damascusa taka Saul chongril</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulin sûn tomte Damascusa iempungei kôm oma. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Synagog taka a lût pata Khrista thurchi a rila, Jisua chu Pathien nâipasal ani tiin a ril phut kelen zoia.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>A chongril riet ngei murdi'n asân an kamâm tataka, “Hi mi hih Jerusalema Jisua riming ralam ngei dûk lei mintong ngâipu hah nimak mo? Ha mingei hah khita ochaisingei kôma tuong ranga mahin khom a hong nimak mo?” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Hannirese Saul chongril hah ranak a dôn teteta, male Jisua chu Khrista ani tiin a ril minthâr han mi a mene thei oka, Damascus taka aom Judangei khomin makhal thei khâi mak ngei.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kor 11:32</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref></char>
    </note> Sûn tamtak suole chu Saul that rangin Judangei lungvâr an thoa, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>hannirese ama'n an lungvâr tho hah a rieta, that rang bôkin rukul mokot tina sûn le jân an muruonga. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Hannirese a nûkjûingeiin Saul an tuonga, jâna rukul kotvêng renga kok leh makhâiin an musum zoi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema Saul chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Hanchu Saul hah Jerusalema a sea, ruoisingei inloppui rang a bôka, hannirese anni han ruoisi ani sa ti iem mak ngeia, anrêngin achiin an chia. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Hanchu Barnabas a tuonga tîrtonngei kôm a sepuia. Lampuia Pumapa a mu tie ngei, Pumapa'n a kôma a ti pe ngei, Damascusa taka Jisua riminga hâitaka chong a ril tie ngei an kôm a misîr pe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Male Saul hah an kôm a om zoia, Jerusalem pumpuia hâitakin Pumapa rimingin chong a rila. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Greek chong mangin Judangei lâia chong a rila, a makhala, anni rêkin chu that rangin an pûta. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Ha chong hah koiindang mingeiin an rietin chu Saul hah Caesarea khuo an tuonga, Tarsus khuoa an tîr pat zoi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Male Judea ram, Galilee ram le Samari ram pumpuia koiindang hah dengtheina an jôk zoia. Pumapa mân thôn an oma, Ratha Inthieng ompuinân an rât uola, an mijôn ahong pung tetet zoia.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ludda le Joppa khuoa Peter sintho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Peter'n muntina a chaia, sûnkhat chu Ludda khuo Pathien mingei omna a juong sea. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Mahan mi inkhat a riming Aeneas an ti kum riet phalkhatthi sika jâlmuna jâl a mua. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Peter'n a kôm han, “Aeneas, Jisua Khrista'n nang a mindam zoi inthoi inla na jâlmun luok roh,” a tia, hanchu harenghan ânthoia. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Ludda le Sharona mi murdi'n ama an mua Pumapa tieng an hong inhei zoi.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Joppa khuoa han Jisua lei iem nuvengte inkhat a riming Tabitha a oma. (Greek riming Dorcas, mahi, “sakhi,” tina ani.) Amanu han azora dôn murdi sin sa le inriengngei sannân a lei mang ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Ma zora han dam maka, a thi zoia, tui an min buola inchunginchuon khâltana an min jâla. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Ludda khuo hah Joppa khuo kôl ani sikin, iempungeiin Peter Ludda khuoa aom ti an rieta, “Rangâihoitakin inrangralin mi hong pe roh,” tia koi rangin mi inik an tîra. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Masikin Peter inthoiin anni ngei lehan an sea. A tung leh an inchunginchuon khâltan sûnga an tuonga. Dorcas kôla indingin meithâingei tamtakin an chapa, an kôm aom lâia kâncholingei le puonngei hah a sûi ngei hah Peter an min mua. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Peter'n anrêngin pêntieng a mojôk ngeia, male Khûkinbilin chubai a thoa, hanchu ruok tieng ânheia, “Tabitha inthoi roh,” a tia. Tabitha hah a hong menga Peter hah a mua, a hong insunga. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Peter'n a kut a pêka a kaithoia, hanchu iempungei le meithâingei a koia, Tabitha hah aringin a pêk ngei zoi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Ma roi hah Joppa khuoa ânthang zita, mi tamtakin Pumapa an hong iem zoi. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Peter chu sûn tamtak Joppa khuo savun sinngâipu Simon ina ala châma.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Peter le Cornelius</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Caesarea khuo mi inkhat a riming Cornelius an ti, “Rom râlmi pâl raza-ruoipu a oma” maha Italy râlmi an ti ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Ama hah Pathien biek mi ania, ama leh a insûng mingei nâm anrêngin Pathien lei biek ngâi an ni. Judangei lâia inriengngei sanin asân ranak a song ngâia, Pathien kôma khom chubai a tho bang ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Sûnkhat chu chonûk dâr thumin inlârna inthârlak a mua, Pathien vântîrton inkhat a kôm ahong lûta, “Cornelius!” a hong tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Cornelius'n ama hah a en ngita, a chia, “Pu mahi imo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Vântîrtonin a thuona nu chubaithona le nu lungkhamna sinngei hah Pathien'n a râisânna nang a thuon rang ke ani zoi. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Atûn Joppa khuoa mi tîr inla, mi inkhat a riming Simon Peter an ti hah hong min koi roh. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Savun sin ngâipu Simon ina a tunga, a in chu tuikhanglien panga aom a tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Hanchu vântîrton hah a rot suole, Cornelius'n a tîrlâmngei mi inik le râlmi inkhat, Pathien biek ngâi a tîrlâma a mang ngâi a koia. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>A mu le a riet murdi a ril zoiin chu Joppa khuoa se rangin a tîra.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Anangtûka an sea, Joppa khuo kôl an tungin chu, Peter hah chubaitho rangin sûna inchunga a kala. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>A von a châm sabaka, bunêk rang a nuoma hannisenla nêk rang a mintuo lâitakin inlârna a mua. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Invân in-ongin puon lienpa arikil minlia inthung invân renga nuoia juong chum a mua. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Ha sûng han sa ake minli jât tamtakngei le rama vângei an omna, a rôpa intolngâi ngei. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>A kôm han rôlin, Peter, “Inthoi roh; that inla sâk roh!” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Hannisenla Peter'n “Pumapa nimak! ânthiengloi le porinche ite sâk ngâi mu ung” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Rôl han avêlin a kôma, “Pathien'n ânthieng zoi a ti hih nangman ite ânthiengloiin mindon no roh,” a ti nôka. <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Ha anghan, voithum ajuong oma, masuole chu invân tieng lâk paiin a om nôk zoi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Hanchu, Peter'n inlârna a mu hah a mindonna chang riet loiin a om lâitak han, Cornelius mi tîr ngei hah Simon in rekelin mokot kôla an lên dinga. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Mahin Simon Peter a tung mo? tiin an rekela.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Peter'n inlârna ai mu hah a mindon lâitakin, Ratha'n a kôma, “Rangâi roh! Mi inthumin nang an rok. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Masikin inthok inla chum roh, ite kamâm loiin jûi ngei roh, anni hah ko hongtîr ngei ke” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Masikin Peter hah a chuma, an kôm han, nin rokpu hah “Keima ki ni, imo nin hongna abi?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Anni han, “Râlmi raza ruoipu Cornelius mi hongtîr ani. Ama hah mi sa Pathien biek ngâi mi le Juda mi murdi'n mirit an tho ngâi mi ania. Pathien vântîrtonin nangma hah a ina koi rangin a tipea, no chongril rangâi rangin” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Ha mingei hah a koi lût ngeia, a min riek ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Anangtûka ânthoka anni ngei leh, Joppa khuo iempu senkhat ngei le munkhatin an sea. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Anangtûk nôka chu Caesarea khuo an tung zoia, Cornelius han a sûngsuokngei le a ruolngei a koibûma, Peter ngei an lei ngâk chiena. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Hanchu Peter ava lût rangtôn Cornelius'n a lei dônna, a ke bula khûkinbilin chubai a mûka. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Aniatachu Peter'n ama hah a kaithoia, “Inding roh, kei khom miriem dên ke ki ni,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>A kôm chong pumin insûnga a lûta, mi tamtak intûp ngei hah ava mua. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>An kôm han, “Juda mîn, Juda mi niloi pan rang le inloppui rangin Juda balamin phal mak ti nangni rengin nin riet. Hannirese, tute inthiengloi le annima ke be loina rangin Pathien'n mi min mu ani. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Masika han mi nin hong min koia han, ite makhal viet loiin ko hong kelen ani. Masik han nangni ki rekel imo mi nin hong koina bi?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Cornelius'n a kôma, “Atûn zora tena hin sûnthum ani zoi. Chonûk dâr thum vêlin ki ina chubai ko thoa; harenghan mi inkhat puon chêk invo ka makunga a juong indinga. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>‘Cornelius! Pathien'n nu chubaithona a riet zoi, nu lungkhamna sin ngei khom a riettit. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Masikin Joppa khuoa mi tîr inla Simon Peter hong min koi roh, ama hah tuikhanglien panga savun sin ngâipu Simon ina a tung ani’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Male han no kôm mi ko hongtîr kelena; no hong hih râisân aom sabak. Pumapa'n chongril ranga nang a pêk riet rangin atûn hin Pathien mitmu'n kin rêngin kin om ani hi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter chongril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bal 10:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Peter a hong chonga hi anghin a tia: “Pathien'n jâttin le namtin in-angsara a en ti ki riet minthâr zoi. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Namtin lâia tukhom ama iema sin asa thopu murdi chu ama khôk thei mi anni ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Ama'n, mi murdi Pumapa, Jisua Khrista han Israel mingei kôma rangin inchamna râisânna Thurchi Sa chu a juong mintunga. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>John'n Baptis roi a ril suole Galilee ram renga a phuta, Judea ram pumpuia a roi a chongril hah nin lei rieta. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Nazareth Jisua chu Pathien'n Ratha Inthieng le sinthotheinân min silin, Pathien han a ompui tita, sin sa thoa muntina a chai lâihan Diabol dûkmintong murdi ngei a mindama. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Judea ram le Jerusalema a sintho murdi rietpuipungei kin ni, ama hah Khrosa jêmdelin an that ani. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Hanniresea, Pathien'n sûnthum suole a kaithoia mu theiin ânlâra, <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>mitin mitmua chu inlâr maka, Pathien'n a rietpuipu ranga a lei thang keini ngei vai hin kin mu, ânthoinôk suole han Ama lehan kin sâkin kin nêk suom ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Male hah thurchisa ril rang le Ama hah mi ring le mithi chunga roijêkpu'n Pathien'n a phun ti mi murdi min riet rangin chong mi pêk ani. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Dêipungei murdi khomin ama iem murdi'n a riming sikin an sietnangei ngâidam nîng an tih,” tiin an lei ril ngâi a tia.<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jentailngei Ratha Inthieng an chang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Peter chong a la ril bang lâiin, a chongril rangâi murdi chunga Ratha Inthieng ajuong chuma. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Juda iempungei Joppa khuo renga Peter hong jûipungei han Ratha Inthieng neinun pêk Jentailngei chunga khom ivur ani ti an rieta an kamâm oka. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Chong rietloia chongrilin le Pathien roiinpuina minpâkin an rieta, Peter'n a thuona, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>“Hi mingei hi kin chang anga Ratha Inthieng an chang ania, tuia baptis chang rangin tumo khap thei ngei ranga?” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Masikin Jisua Khrista riminga baptis chang rang chong a pêk ngeia. Hanchu anni kôm han sûn tômte la châm rangin an ngêna.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jerusalem koiindangngei kôma a sintho a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Judea ram pumpuia tîrtonngei le iempungei hah Jentailngei khom Pathien chong an rieta an lei modôm zoi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Peter hah Jerusalema a sea, hanchu sertan ngei han ama an lei dema, a kôm, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>“Sertanloi Jentailngei ina nu tunga an kôma sâk khom na sâk ngâi!” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Masikin Peter'n abul renga anrêngin aroi omtie murdi a misîrpe ngâia.<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>“Joppa khopuiliena chubai ko tho lâiin, inlârna ku mua. Puon chêk lientak anghan arikil minlia inthung invân renga juong musum ko kôla juong om ku mua. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Mahan anâikikin ke enna insûng sa le ram sa, rôpa intol ngâi le vângei ku mua. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Masuole chong mirîng ki rieta ko kôm, ‘Inthoi roh Peter; that inla sâk roh,’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Hannirese keiman ‘Nimak Pumapa! ânthieng loi le ânnim ite ka bâia lût ngâi mak’ ki tia. <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Invân renga rôl han avoiniknân, ‘Pathien'n ânthieng a ti sai hi nangman inthieng mak tino roh!’ a ti nôka. <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Ma anghan voithum ajuong oma masuole azoinataka chu invân tieng lâk pâiin a oma. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Ma zora tak han Caesarea renga mi inthum hongtîra om ngei hah ko omna in an hong tunga. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Ratha'n mulung inlakloia anni ngei jûi ngei rangin mi rila. Hi iempu uruk Joppa renga Caesarea hong ngei khom min jûisa kin rêngin Cornelius ina kin lûta. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Ama han a ina vântîrton inding a mua, vântîrton han a kôma, Joppa khuoa mi tîr inla mi inkhat a riming Simon Peter an ti hah hong minkoi roh. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Ama han chong nang misîrpe a ta, ama chong han nangma le ni insûngmingei sânminjôkin om nin tih, tiin khom mi ril sa. <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Chongril ko hong phut lehan motona ei chunga ajuongtung anghan Ratha Inthieng an chunga ajuongtunga. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Sin 1:5</ref></char></note> Male Pumapa'n a ti ‘John'n tui le mi a baptis ania, nangni chu Ratha Inthiengin baptis la chang nin tih,’ a ti hah ki rietsuok nôka. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Pumapa Jisua Khrista ei iema ama chongpêk nanâk hah Jentailngei khom a pêk ani ti ânthâr ani. Kei hih tumo ki ni, Pathien khap rang bôkpu hi!” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Ma chong hah an riet lechu dem khâi mak ngei, Pathien an minpâka, “Pathien'n Jentailngei khom insîra ring rangin zora inchum a pêk ani hi!” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antioch koiindanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Sin 8:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hanchu Stephan an that zora dûkmintongna sika chekinchâi ngei hah Phoenicia Ram, Cyprus tuikul le Antioch khuo dênin an sea Judangei kôm vai thurchi an rila. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Hannirese, iempu senkhat: Cyprus tuihuol le Cyrene a mingei hah Antioch'a an sea, Jentailngei kôm khom Thurchi Sa an misîra, Pumapa Jisua Thurchi Sa an rila. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Pumapa ranakin a san ngeia, mi tamtakin an iema, Pumapa tieng an inhei zoia.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ma thurchi hah Jerusalema koiindang ngeiin an lei rieta, masikin Barnabas hah Antioch taka an tîra. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Ama hah a tungin chu mataka mingei Pathien'n satavur tie hah a mûn chu a râisân tataka, an mulungngei murdia Pathien taksônna om mindet rangin anrêngin a mohôk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnabas hah mi satak, Ratha Inthieng le iemna sip ania, masikin mi tamtak Pumapa tieng a tuong zoia.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Hanchu Barnabas hah Saul rokin Tarsus khuoa a sea. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>A mu lehan Antioch tieng a hong tuonga, kum khat piel koiindangngei inkhômna an inchel ngâia, mi tamtak an minchu sa ngâi. Antioch'a han kêng iempungei hah Khristien an ti masatak.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Ma zora han Dêipu senkhat ngei Jerusalem renga Antioch an sea. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Sin 21:10</ref></char></note> An lâia mi inkhat a riming Agabus ândinga rammuol pumpuia mâitâm natak chul atih, ti ratha min rietin a phuonga; ha mâitâm hah Claudius inlal lâiin atung zoi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Ha anghan, ruoisingei han an thei lam chitin Judea rama iempungei kôm sanna muthuon rang an masata. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Ma hah an thoa masuole sum han koiindang upangei kôm pêk rangin Barnabas le Saul kuta an muthuon zoi.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nuomlona rik uol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Hanchu, ma zora han, Rêng Herod'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">rêng Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keima, Herod Agrippa Palistine rama murdia roijêkpu.</char></note> koiindanga mi senkhat ngei a nunuom a lo zoia. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Jacob, John nâipa hah khandaiin a tuk thata. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Ama han Judangei an râiasân ok ti a rietin chu Peter khom sûr rang a bôk tita. (Ma zora hah cholboivâipôl ruolhoi zora ani). <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Jôk 12:1-27</ref></char></note>Peter hah a sûr suole chu intâng ina a khuma, râlmi pâl minli minlin angâk an inthâklîpa. Kalkân kût ruolhoi chumin mipui makunga kai suoa jêk rangin a mintuo ani. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Masikin Peter hah intâng ina a khum rapa, hannirese, ama ta rangin koiindangngeiin ningsiettakin Pathien kôm chubai an thope ngâi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter intâng in renga ajôkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Herod'n a kai suoa, a jêk rang nijân tak han chu Peter hah rungpungei inik kâra rênrokol inik bunin a jâla, a ngâkngei khom mokot bula an oma, an ngâk chiena. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Inningloiin vântîrton inkhat a kôla ajuong indinga intâng in sûnga han vâr ajuong inlanga. Vântîrton han Peter dâra anîk min hara, “Inrangin! inthoi roh!” a tia. Hanchu, voikhatrengin Peter kuta rênrokolngei hah a kutngei renga a tâkrila. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Masuole Vântîrton han a kôm, “No kongkhit mindên inla, ne kekok bun roh,” a tia. Peter'n ha anghan a thoa, hanchu vântîrton han a kôm, “Na kâncholiinchuol inhak inla, mi jûi roh,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Peter intâng in renga a jôka, a jûi zoia; nikhomrese a tak ani ti riet mak, Vântîrton hah inlârna a mu mini kêng a bôka. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>A rungngei inkhatna le inikna an khêlin chu khopuiliena lûtna thîr mokot an va tunga. Mokot hah athethenin alei in-onga, an jôka, lamlien inkhat an khêlin chu voikhatrengin vântîrton han Peter a mâk zoia.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Hanchu Peter hah a harin chu, “Pumapa'n a vântîrton a juongtîra, Herod kut renga le Judangei sabeina murdi renga mi mojôk ti adiktakin ki riet zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>A mulung a min chong zoiin chu John Mark nû Mary ina a sea, mahan mi tamtak lên bûmin an lei chubaia. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Peter'n bokrop inkhâr a tôk lehan, tîrlâm inkhat Rhoda dôngmate han mo-ong rangin a sea. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Peter rôl a riet lechu a râisân rai sikin inkhâr mo ong loiin a tân nôka, “Peter inkot bula son ânding,” tiin a va rila. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Anni han a kôm, “Na châng ani zoi hi!” an tia. Ama'n chu adik tatak kêng? a ti tita. Anni han “a vântîrton nîng atih,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Nikhomrese Peter'n a tôk tita nûktaka chu an va mo onga, ama hah an mua kamâm aom an ti tataka. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Ama han an dâirekna rangin a kut a jâpa, Pumapa'n intâng in renga a kêlsuo tie hah a misîr zoia. Hanchu, “Hi chong hih Jacob le iempu dangngei va ril roi,” a tia. Masuole chu a jôka ram danga a se zoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Hanchu, jîng ahongni lechu rungpungei hah, Peter imo a chang zoi? tiin asân an mulung ajîng zoia. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herod han a rok rangin chong a pêk ngeia, hannirese mu mak ngeia a ngâkngei hah a rekela, that ngei rangin chong a pêk ngei zoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Masuole chu, Herod judea khuo a mâka Caesarea khuoa môrkhat ava om zoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod thina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Hanchu, Herod hah Tyre le Sidon khuo mingei chunga a taksi sabaka. Anni han inruolin ama kôm se rangin an honga, rêng milien Blastus hah an malin an sin baka. Masuole Herod kôm an sea, an ram hah rêngpa ram renga sâk, nêk an man ngâi ani sikin inngêi rangin an ngêna.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>A nikhuo khâm nîn chu Herod hah puon inlal insilin rêngsukmuna ânsunga, mipuingei kôm chong a misîra. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Mi murdi'n, “Miriem rôl nimak, Pathien rôl kêng,” an tia, an inieka. <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Voikhatrengin ama han Pathien kôm miritna a pêk loi sikin Pumapa vântîrtonin voikhatrengin Herod chunga a kut a musuma, rûlkûtin a sâka, athi zoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Ma lâia han Pathien chong ânzara an pung tir zoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnabas le Saul'n an sintum an sin suole chu Jerusalem renga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">renga; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn</char></note> an kîr nôk zoia, John Mark hah an kôm an tuong sa.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Barnabas le Saul an thangna le an tîrna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Hanchu, Antioch koiindangngei lâia Dêipungei le minchupungei an oma; Ma ngei hah Barnabas ngei, Simeon (miduk an ti) ngei, Cyrene khuoa Lucius ngei, Manaen (Râiôt Herod'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft">Herod Antipas, Galilee rama ânlal lâiin (en roh Luk 3.1).</char></note> a vâi minlien) ngei le Saul ngei an ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Pumapa sin an thoa, bu an ngêi lâiin Ratha Inthiengin an kôm, “Barnabas le Saul hih ko koina lama sintho rangin mi pêk roi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Bungêiin chubai an tho zoiin chu an chunga kutngei an minngama, an tîr ngei zoi.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cyprus tuihuola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Ha anghan, Ratha Inthieng tîrin an sea, Seleucia khuo an tunga, ha mun renga Cyprus tuihuola rukuongin an se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Hanchu, Salamis khuoa an tungin chu Judangei Synagog ngeia Pathien thurchi an misîra. John Mark hah an insanpui rangin an tuong sa.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Tuihuol hah Paphos dênin an chai suoa, dôithei, dêipu inti Juda inkhat a riming Bar-Jisua an tonga. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Ama hah tuihuol râiôt Sergius Paulus mi vâr tak khom a malpa ania. Ha râiôt han Pathien chong rangâi a nuom sikin Barnabas le Saul a koia. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Hannirese, dôipu Elimus (Greek riming) han râiôt hah takminsôn loi rang pûtin anni hah a lei deia. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Hanchu Saul, Paul an ti sa ngâi hah Ratha Inthiengin a sipa, dôipu hah a en ngita, a kôm, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>male “Nangma khori nâipasal! satnangei nâm râlpa, milak ngei nâmin ni minsipa, zoratin Pathien chongtakngei hih chong milak min chang rang no bôk ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Atûn Pumapa kut nu chunga achum rang ani, ni mit jîng a ta, sûn khovâr mu khâino tini,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Sûm le ijîngin ama hah abok kelen zoia, a kairuoi rang mi zongin ânvâk titira. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Râiôt han ahong mu lehan khoimo atung hah, a iem zoia; Pumapa minchuna chungroi hah a kamâm oka.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidia rama Antioch</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Paul le a champuingei hah Paphos khopuilien renga rukuongin an sea, Pamphylia rama Perga an tunga, mahan John Mark'n anni hah a mâka, Jerusalema a kîr nôk zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Anni hah Perga renga an se tita, Pisidia rama Antioch an tunga, male Sabbathnin chu Synagog taka an lûta, an insunga. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Moses balam le dêipungei lekhabungei an miziekngei hah an pore suole chu Synagog ulienngeiin an kôm mi an tîra: “Sûngsuokngei, mohôkna chong nin dôn aomin chu mipuingei kôm misîr rangin nangni kin nuom ani,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Paul ândinga, a kutin a jâpa, thurchi misîr a phut zoia:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Ki Israel champuingei le Jentialngei murdi Pathien biek ngei, ko chong rangâi roi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Jôk 1:7</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Jôk 12:51</ref></char></note>Israelngei Pathien mingei ei richibulngei a lei thanga, Egypt khuolmingei anghan an om lâiin nam lienpân a sina, a ranak lienin Egypt renga a kai suo ngeia, <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Tel 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Bal 1:31</ref> </char></note>male kum sômminli ramchâra an sinthongei hah a en chien theia. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Bal 7:1</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1">Jos 14:1</ref></char></note>Canaan rama nam sari an inmanga, a mingei a ram puma a minchang zoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Ma ngei nâm hah <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Roi 2:16</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam 3:20</ref></char></note>Kum raza minli sômrangnga alût ani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Masuole han roijêkpungei a pêk ngeia, dêipu Samuel dêna han. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam 8:5</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:21">1 Sam 10:21</ref></char></note>Male Rêng an ngêna, ma anghan Pathien'n Saul, Kish nâipasal, Benjamin rûia mi hah kum sômminli sûnga an rêng rangin a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam 13:14</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:12">1 Sam 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Lap 89:20</ref></char></note>Ama hah an hengpai suole chu Pathien'n David hah an rêng aminchanga, ma chungroi hah Pathien'n hi anghin a misîra; ‘David Jesse nâipasal, ku lungdo mi ka mân zoi, ama han sin ranga ku nuom murdi sin a tih,’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Mahi Jisua, David richisuonpârngei lâi renga han Israel mingei Sanminringpu'n ai sin ani, Pathien'n a lei khâm anghan. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3:3</ref> </char></note>Jisua'n a sin a phut mân han, Israel mingei an sietnangei renga an insîra baptisma an changna rangin John'n thurchi a misîr pe ngei ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Joh 1:20</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mk 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Joh 1:27</ref></char></note>Male John'n a sintum a zoi rangto han mipuingei kôm, ‘Keima hih tumo ani mi nin ti? nin ngâkpu hah keima hih ni mu ung. Aniatachu, rangâi ta u! ku nûka juong a tih, kei chu a kekok khek rang luo inhoi mu ung,’ a tia.<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>“Abraham richisuonpârngei, ki richibulngei le Jentailngei murdi Pathien biek ngei, hi Sanminringna chong hih ei kôm a juongtîr ani. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Jerusalema mi omngei le an ruoipungei han sanminringpu ani an riet loi sik le dêipungei chong Sabbathni tina an pore ngâi hah aomtie an rietloi sikin Jisua theiloi min changin dêipungei chong an mintung min dik zoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mk 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Joh 19:15</ref></char></note>Thina rang rak dôr a chunga ite abi an man no khomin that rangin Pilat kôm an ngêna. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19:38-42</ref> </char></note>Male a chungroi Pathien lekhabu'n a miziek murdi atung suole chu Khros renga an musuma, thâna an min jâl zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Aniatachu, Pathien'n thina renga a kaithoi nôk zoi, <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Sin 1:3</ref></char></note>Galilee ram renga Jerusalema ama leh munkhata lei se ngei kôm han sûn tamtak ânlâr ngâia; ha mingei hah atûna hin Israel mingei kôm ama rietpuipungei an ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32-33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lap 2:7</ref></char></note> Ei richibulngei kôma Pathien'n chong a lei khâm hah, eini a richisuonpârngei ta rangin Pathien'n atûna hih Jisua kaithoiin atung ani ti Thurchi Sa nangni kin mintung pe. Lapui inikna taka aom anghan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:32-33">‘Ka Nâipasal ni ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:32-33">Avien hin na Pa ko hongni zoi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref> (LXX) </char>
    </note>Monna mun thâna kîr nôk khâi loi rangin Pathien'n ama hah thina renga a kaithoi rang roi hi anghin a misîra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Satvurna inthieng le adik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">David kôma kên khâm hah nang pêk ki tih,’ tiin.<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Lap 16:10</ref> </char>
    </note>Masikin, minpâkna la dangin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ni mi inthieng chu thâna mon rangin phal no ti nih,’ ati sa.<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>David'n ama zora kai chu Pathien lungdo a sina, masuole chu a thia, a richibulngei leh an phûma, a takpum hah thâna amon zoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Pathien'n thina renga a kaithoipu ha chu mon mak. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39"/>Ki Israel sûngsuokngei, mahih nin riet rangin kin nuom, Jisua sikin ani sietnangei ngâidamna chong nin kôma misîrin aom; male tukhom ama iem kai chu Moses balamin a mojôk theiloi sietnangei murdi renga an jôk zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Masikin, indîn roi, dêipungei lei ti hah nin chunga tung duoi nih.<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> ‘Mumâkpungei, en ta u! kamâm aom ti ungla, thi roi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">asikchu aviena sin ko tho hih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Mîn nangni ril minthâr pe khom rese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ngei iem no tunui!’ ” ti hah a tia.<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Paul le Barnabas hah Synagog renga an jôkin chu sabbathni nôka ma chong hah hong misîr nôk rangin mipuingei han an siela. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Ânbûm ngei an chîn zoiin chu Judangei le an Juda rotholngei tamtakin Paul le Barnabas an jûia, Tîrtonngei han, Pathien moroina nuoi han om tit rangin an mohôka.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Sabbathni nôka chu a khopui pumpui ti dôrin Pathien chong rangâi rangin an hong intûpa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Judangei han mipuingei an mûn chu an narsa oka, Paul thurchi misîr hah an makhala, an misîr minpôta. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Aniatachu Paul le Barnabas han hâi uolin an misîra, “Pathien chong hi nin kôma misîr masa rang piel ani; hannirese, nin henga, kumtuong ringna manpui rangin ahunin nin be loi sikin, nangni mâkin Jentailngei tieng pan kin tih. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note>Mahi Pumapa chong mi pêk ani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Jentailngei min vârpu'n nang ki minchang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">masikin rammuol murdi an ring theina rangin ti hi,’ ” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Jentailngei han ha chong hah an rietin chu an râiasâna, Pumapa chong an chôiminsânga; kumtuong ringna chang ranga thang ngei kai chu iempungei an hong chang zoi.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Pumapa chong hah ramhuol muntina ânzar zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Hannirese Khopuiliena Juda ulienngei le Pathien biek mi Jentail nupang mirit omngei an misieta; Paul le Barnabas hah an nuom an min loa, an ramhuol renga an rujûlpai zoia. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mk 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref> </char></note> Tîrtonngei han anni ngei chunga an mulung hoiloi minlangnân an kepha taka pildi an không mathâka, Iconium an pan zoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Antioch taka iempungei chu râisânna le Ratha Inthiengin an sip zoi.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Iconiuma Paul le Barnabas thurchi misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ma angdên han Iconiuma khom Judangei Synagog taka an lûta, thurchi an misîra, Juda le Jentail tamtakin an iem zoia. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Hannirese a iem nuomloi Judangei han Jentailngei an misieta an min mumâk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Tîrtonngei han hâitaka Pumapa thurchi misîrin ha khuoa han sôttak an oma; mahan a lungkhamna chongril tîrtonngeiin an misîr hah adik ti minlangnân an kuta sininkhêlngei le sin kamâmruoingei an sina. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Khopuilien sûnga mipuingei pâl inikin an insen zoia. Senkhat Judangei tieng, senkhat tîrtonngei tieng.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Hanchu Jentailngei le Judangei an ruoipungei le tîrtonngei hah lung leh dênga dûkmintong rang an bôka. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Tîrtonngeiin ma chong hah an lei riet lechu Lycaonia rama Lystra le Derbe khopuilienngei le a kol revêla ram ngeia an rota. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Mahan annîn Thurchi Sa an misîr tir zoi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lystra le Derbe khuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Lystra khuoa mi inkhat a suok renga kholra lôn theiloi a oma. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Mahan ama ânsunga Paul thurchi misîr a rangâia. Damna ranga iemna a nei ti Paul'n a mûn chu ama hah Paul'n a en ngita, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>male rôl inringtakin, “Ne ke le injîkzatin inding roh!” a tia. Ama hah ân chôma, a lôn titir kelen zoi. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Mipuingeiin Paul sintho hah an mu lechu anni Lycaonia chongin an inieka, “Pathienngei miriem changin ei kôm an juong chum ani hih!” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Barnabas riming hah Zeus an tia, male Paul hah thurchi misîr uol ngâi ani sikin Hermes an tia. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Hanchu, Zeus pathien ochai, an biekin, khopui pêntienga om han serâtchalngei le pârthilrûingei mokota a hongchôia, mipuingei lehan tîrtonngei biekna ranga that rangin an mintuoa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Ma anga tho ranga an mintuo hah Barnabas le Paul'n an riet lechu an puon an potkhêra, mipui lâi tieng tânin an inieka. <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Jôk 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Lap 146:6</ref></char></note> “Mahih irang mo nin tho? keini khom nangni anga miriem papai kêng kin ni. Mahin keini hih Thurchi Sa misîr ranga om ke kin ni, hi kâmnângloi neinunngei hih mâka Pathien aring, invân, pilchung, tuikhanglien le an sûnga om murdi Sinpu tienga nin hong kop theina rangin. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Tiena han chu, Pathien'n mitin an lampui chit jûi rangin a phal ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Hannirese ama aom ti rietnân neinun sa nangni thopên a minlang ngâi. Invân renga ruo le chimungei azora taka nangni a pêk ngâia, sâk rang le nin mulungrîla râisâna sip nangni a pêk ngâi” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Ha chonga han tîrtonngeiin mipuingei chu an kôm inbôlna pêk loi rangin an khap thei jâma.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Pisidia rama Antioch le Iconium renga Juda senkhatngei an honga; mipuingei hah an tieng an methêm mene zoia; Paul hah lung leh an dênga, a thi zoi tiin an mindona khopui renga an kai suoa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Hannirese, iempungei hah a kôla an hong indingin chu ânthoia, khopuia han a lût nôk zoia. Anangtûkah chu Barnabas le Derbea an se zoi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Syria rama Antioch khuo taka an kîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Paul le Barnabas'n Derbea han Thurchi Sa an misîra, ruoisi tamtak an man nûkin Lystra, Iconium le Pisidia rama Antioch ngeia an kîr nôka. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>“Intakna tamtak tuong ngêtin Pathien Rêngrama ei lût rang ani,” tia minchûn iempungei hah an mindeta, taksôn dika omtit rangin an mohôka. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Koiindang tina upangei an phun pe ngei tira, bungêiin an chubai suole an iemna Pumapa, an taksônpu kuta an bâng tir zoia.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Pisidia ram an sir zoiin chu Pamphylia ram an hong tunga. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Perga taka thurchi an misîr zoiin chu Attalia an sea, <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>ma renga hah chu rukuongin Antioch an se nôk zoia. Ha mun hah hi zora an chuonsin an zoi hih, an phut rang lâia Pathien moroina kuta bânga an omna mun hah ani.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Antioch an tungin chu koiindangngei an koibûma, anni ngei manga Pathien'n sin a tho ngei murdi le Jentailngei ta ranga iemna lampui a mo-ong pe ngei tie hah an rila. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Mahan iempungei leh zora sôtzan an oma.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema roijêkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Och 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mi senkhat Judea ram renga Antioch an juonga, “Moses Balam anghan sertan nin tho nônchu sanminring ni thei no tu nui,” tiin iempungei an minchua. <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Paul le Barnabas han ma roia han anni ngei hah an inkhalpui ngei oka, masikin, Paul le Barnaba le an lâia mi senkhat le ha bâiinkhamna chungroia han Jerusalema tîrtonngei le upangei hong intongpui rangin an minsûk zoia.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Koiindangin an hong mathâna, anni han Jentailngei Pathien tienga an inlet roi hah misîr tîrin Phoenicia ram le Samaria ram an sir suoa ha an misîr renga han iempungei murdi an râiasân oka. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Jerusalem an tungin chu koiindangin tîrtonngei le upangeiin an lei modôma ma ngei kôm han Pathien'n anni ngei ma anga sin a tho ngei murdi hah an rila. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Hannirese Pharisee pâla mi iempungei senkhat an indinga, “Jentailngei sertan ngêta, Moses Balam an jôm rangin tipe ngei rang ani” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Tîrtonngei le upangei, ha roi hah jêk rangin an intûpa. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Sin 10:1-43</ref></char></note> Asôt tak an inkhal suo nûkin Peter ândinga, “Sûngsuokngei, Jentailngei Pathien chong an rieta, an iem theina ranga Thurchi Sa misîr pe ngei ranga nin lâi renga tien renga Pathien'n mi zen ani ti hah nin riet. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Sin 10:44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">Sin 2:4</ref></char></note>Mitin mindona rietpu Pathien'n ei kôm mi pêk anghan Jentailngei khom Ratha Inthieng pêk sân a khôk tiin ânlanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Eini le anni sensâi loiin, an iem sikin an sietnangei a ngâidam zoia. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Masikin, ei richibulngei le eini pêl zoi khâiloi puok hah atûna hin iempungei chunga mokhop pe rang bôkin irang mo Pathien nin minsin hi? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Ni mak! Anni ngei angdênin eini khom Pumapa Jisua iema moroina han Sanminring ei ni,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Barnabas le Paul'n anni ngei manga Pathien'n Jentailngei lâia sininkhêlngei le kamâmruoingei a sin roi an misîr kâr chu mipuingei nâm an dâireka. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>An misîr suole chu Jacob khomin a misîr sa, “Sûngsuokngei, ko chong rangâi ta u! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Pathien'n ama riming ruput ranga anni ngei lâia ni lâk suok rangin Jentailngei a juong pan phut roi Simon'n a misîr zoia. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Ha chong le dêipungei chong hi ântok thap ani. Pathien lekhabu'n,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amos 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>‘Masuole, Pumapa han kîr nôk ka ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">David omna rêngram achim hah minding nôk ki tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">a sietnangei sin nôk ka ta male</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">mindet nôk ki tih.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Male mi murdi ngei le Jentailngei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Ki mi niranga ko koi ngei nâm Jentailngei ko kôm hong an ta.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Rammuol insieng renga hi chong min riet ngâipu Pumapa han a ti,’ ati anghan.<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>“Masikin Jacob'n, mahi ki mindon chu ani. Jentailngei Pathien tienga hong inlet ngei chu minjêl no ila. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Jôk 34:15-17</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Och 18:6-23</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Och 17:10-16</ref></char></note>Manêkin, lekha muthuonin mirmilngei biekna neinun inthiengloi sâk mo, hur le ngal mo, sâ lei thisai le thisen sâk mo, mong rangin tipe ngei ila ki ti ani. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Moses Balam chu tienlâi renga sabbathni rachamin Synagog taka an pore ngâi zoia, a chongngei khom khopui tina an misîr ngâi zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jentail iempungei kôma lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Hanchu, tîrtonngei, upangei le koiindang pumpuiin an lâia mi senkhat an thanga, Paul le Barnabas pâla Antiocha min se rangin an min chukka. An ulien uol inik iempungeiin an mirit, Judas, Barsabass an ti le Silas an thang ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Hi anghin miziekin, an min chôi ngeia:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Keini, tîrtonngei le upangei nin sûngsuokngeiin kin iempu champui Jentail ânzir ngei Antioch, Syria le Cilicia rama omngei chibaingei nangni kin mûk. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Kin pâla mi senkhatin thurchi juong misîrin nangni an minjêla, mulungjîng nangni an shak ti kin rieta; nikhomrese, anni ngei ha kin kôm renga ite rilnangei man mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Masikin kin intûpa, mulung inruol takin kin thanga nin kôm juongtîr rangin kin minsûk ani. Ei ruol moroitak ngei Barnaba le Paul <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Jisua Khrista sinthona an ringna phal ngei lehin juong rese ngei kin ti. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Ha anghan, Judas le Silas kin juongtîr ani, hi ngei hin kin miziek hih mêl inmun nangni misîr pe an tih. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Ratha Inthieng le inruolin hi balamngei sin om pêna hi chu puok rik dang sin loi rangin kin inruol; <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>mirmilngei biekna sâkruo sâk no roi, thisen sâk no roi, sâ sômthat sâk no roi, hur le ngal renga inkêm roi. Hi ngei hih tho tet loi rangin nin indîn theiin chu nin ta rangin sa ok atih, chibai” tiin.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>An tîrlâmngei hah an sea, Antioch an tunga; mahan iempungei pâl murdi an koibûma, lekhamuthuon hah an pêk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>An pore suole chu ma mohôkna chong sika han râisânin an sip zoia. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Judas le Silas chu dêipungei khom an ti sa, asôtzan an chongpui ngeia, an mohôk ngeia, an min rât oka. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Sûn sôtzan an om suole chu a juongtîr ngei kôm kîr nôk rangin an se zoia, iempungeiin rathangamriemin an mathân ngeia.<verse eid="ACT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Paul le Barnaba chu midang tamtak ngei le Pumapa chong minchu le misîrin Antioch'a han zora sôtzan an la oma.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul le Barnabas an insen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Zora sôtzan suole chu Paul'n Barnabas kôm, “Tho se nôk ei ta, khopui tina Pumapa chong ei misîrna murdia ei sûngsuokngei pan ei ta, i angin mo an om va en ngei rei,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabas'n John Mark an kôm tuongsa rang a nuoma. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Sin 13:13</ref> </char></note> Hannirese Paul'n chu nuom maka, abi chu Pamphylia ram tena a kîra, an sin a zoipui loi sikin ani. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>An inkhal bita, an insen zoia, Barnabas John Mark a tuonga, rukuongin Cyprus tuihuol tieng an sea. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Paul'n chu Silas a thanga, iempungeiin Pumapa moroina kuta an bâng ngei suole chu a se zoi. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Koiindangngei mindet tîrin Syria le Cilicia ram a sir zoi.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timothy'n Paul le Silas a jûi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Paul'n Derbe le Lystra khom a sir sa, mahan Khristien inkhat a riming Timothy a oma. A nû khom Khristien dên Juda mi ania, a pa chu Greek ani. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Lystra le Iconiuma iempungei murdi'n Timothy an minlut ok ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Paul'n ama hah tuong rang a nuoma, ma revêla Judangei han Timothy pa hah Greek ani ti an riet sikin Timothy khom a sertan pe ani. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Khopuingei tin an sir malamin, Jerusalema tîrtonngei le upangei balamngei masat hah iempungei an pêk tira, jôm rang khomin he an be tira. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Masikin, koiindangngei hah taksônnân an rât uola nîngtin an pung titira.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Troas taka Paul inlârna a mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Ratha Inthiengin Asia rama thurchi misîr a khap sikin Phrygia le Galatia ram an sîra. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Mysia ramri an tungin chu Bithynia rama se rang an bôka, hannirese, Jisua Ratha'n phal ngei maka. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Masikin, Mysia ram khêlin Troasa an se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Hanchu, mani jâna han Paul'n inlârnân Macedonia rama mi inkhatin “Macedonia rama hong kâi inla, mi hong san roh,” tia ngênin a mua, <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Paul'n inlârna hi a mu suole chu Macedonia rama se rangin kin inthok kelen zoia, ha rama mingei kôma Thurchi Sa misîr rangin Pathien'n mi koi sikin.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phillipi khuoa Lydia inthûlna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Troas renga rukuongin kin jôka, Samothrace kin thengpata, male anangtûka Neapolis kin sea. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Ha renga hah Philippia kin sea, ha khopuilien hah Macedonia; rama khuo inkhat ania, ma biela han chu khuo kâm omtak ani. Rom mingei bung ani. Ma khuoa han sûn tamtak kin châma. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Sabbathni khopui pêntienga tuidung panga Judangei chubaithona ngâi mun ni ranga kin iema han kin sea; mahan kin insunga nupang intûp ngei kôm thurchi kin misîra. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Ha ngei lâia mi a riming Lydia, Thyatira, khuo mi puon senduk juor ngâi, Pathiena inbei mi nupang inkhatin chong a rieta; male Paul thurchi misîr jôm rangin Pumapa'n a mulungrîl a minvâr pea. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Ama le a inmingeiin baptisma an chang zoiin chu, “Pumapa iem tatakin ni nan bêa anin chu ki ina hong tung roi tiin mi siel rîta,” ni sûr zoi.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phillipia Paul le Silas intâng ina ankhum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Sûnkhat chu chubaithona muna kin se lâiin suok dôngmate inkhat ramkhori sûra taruosân thei kin intongpuia, amanu han taruosân a theina sika han a pu ngei sum tamtak a lo pe ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Hanu han Paul le Keini mi jûia, “Hi mi, Sanminringna lampui nangni ril ngei hih, Ânchungtak Pathien tîrlâmngei an ni hi,” tiin âniek ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Ma anghan, sûn tamtak a tho tenin chu Paul a mulung hoi khâi maka, a takasia. Ramkhori kôm han, “Jisua Khrista rimingin a sûng renga jôk rangin chong nang ke pêk,” a tia. Ha mitmisim kongkâr han a jôk pai kelen zoia. <verse eid="ACT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>A pumangei han an sum manna om khâi mak ti an riet lechu Paul le Silas hah an sûra, roijêkpungei kôm mipui intûpna muna an kai minlûta. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Rom roijêkpungei kôm an min tungin chu, “Hi mingei hih Juda an nia, kin khopuilien sûnga bâiinkhamna an sin ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Balam dang kin balam le ânkâl, keini Rom mingei kin pom rang le kin mang ranga ânthiengloi an misîr ngâi” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Mipuingei hah Paul le Silas jêm rangin an inthoka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Masuole chu roijêkpungei han Paul le Silas puon an khêr pe ngeia, jêm rangin chong an pêka. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>An jêm bit suole jêl ina an khuma, a ngâkpu kôm han asân khumrap rangin chong an pêka. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Ma anghan, intâng insûng ânlâina taka a khum ngei, an kea thing kekok riktak an min bun ngeia.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Jân lâitaka chu Paul le Silas'n Pathien kôm chubai an thoa. Minpâkna lâ an thoa, intâng ina midangngeiin an rangâia. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Inningloiin nîngnupui a honga; intâng in lungphûmngei tena khom ânphêt heta, voikhatrengin inkhârngei hah ân-ong leta, mitin rênrokolngei hah ânkhek rila. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Hanchu, angâkpu a in hah a hong hara, inkhârngei in-ong letin a mua, intâng ina intângngei an rot suo zoi tiin a bôka, khandai a kaidûka, inthat rang a thoa. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Hannirese Paul'n rôl inringtakin, “Ite inlo no roh, kin rêngin kin la om let” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Ama han meiser a roka, a tâna, chi le innîk pumin Paul le Silas ke bula ânbokraka. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Hanchu anni han a ruoi suok ngeia, “Pungei, Sanminringa ko om theina rangin imo ko tho rang?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Anni han, “Pumapa Jisua iem inla, hanchu sanminringin om ni tih, nangma le ni inmingei leh,” tiin an thuona. <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Masuole chu ama le a inmingei han Pumapa thurchi an misîra. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Mani jâna han, ma zora lelea han an sâbengei hah a rusûk pe ngeia; hanchu ama le a inmingei baptisma an chang kelen zoi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Masuole Paul le Silas hah a ina a tuong ngeia, sâk rang a pêk ngeia Pathien an iem zoi sikin an insûng pumin an râiasân tatak zoi ani.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Anangtûk jînga chu Rom roijêkpungei han, “Ha mingei hah mojôk ta roh,” ti chongpêk chôiin misûr ngâi ngei ulienngei an tîra.<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Masikin a ngâkpu han Paul kôm, “Roijêkpungeiin nangni mojôk rangin chong an hong muthuon. Hong jôk ungla, rathânngamtakin se ta roi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Aniatachu, Paul'n misûr ngâi ulienngei kôm, “Rom miriem kêng kin ni, kin tho minchâina om le omloi luo en loiin loko makunga min jêma, intâng ina min khuma. Atûn inrûkin mi mojôk rang an ti na? Ni thei tet no nih! Anni ngêt hong rese ngei, mi hong mojôk rese ngei,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Misûr ngâi ulienngeiin ha chong hah roijêkpungei kôm an misîra; Rom miriem anni ti an rietin chu an chi zoia. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Masikin an sea an vânvûia, male chu an mojôk ngeia khopuilien renga jôkpai rangin an ngêna. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Paul le Silas hah intâng in renga an jôka, Lydia ina an sea. Mahan iempungei hah an mua, mohôkna chong an pêk ngei suole chu an mâk ngei zoia.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Thessalonika khopuia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Paul le Silas hah Amphipolis le Apollonia an khêla. Thessalonika an tunga. Mahan Judangei Synagog taka ava oma. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Paul'n a tho ngâi balam anghan an kôm a lûta, sabbathnia voithum Pathien lekhabu renga asân a sûtpuiin, <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Messiah chu dûktonga thina renga ânthoinôk rang piel ani ti a rilminthâra, a minlang ngâia, “Hi Jisua, nin lâia ku phuong hih Messiah ani,” a ti sa ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>An lâia senkhat chu Paul thurchi misîr hah an iema, Paul le Silas hah an jôm zoia; nupang ruoipu tamtak le Pathiena inbei mi Greek mipuingei lehan.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Hannirese Judangei han an narsa, lamliena thaboi pâlngei hah an tuonga, mipui an koibûma, khopuilien pumpui bâiinkham chara, Paul le Silas hah loko makunga tuong rang bôkin Jason in an hong lûtkhuma. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Hannirese, an manloi lehan chu, Jason le iempu senkhatngei hah khopuilien ulienngei makunga an hong kainâl ngeia, an inieka. “Hi mingei hin muntina bâiinkhamna an sin ngâi! atûna hin ei khopuiliena an hong ani. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Jason hin a ina a lei mintung ngei ngâia. Hi ngei hin, a riming Jisua, Rêng dang aom tiin Caesar balam an siet ngâi,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Ma chong hah an rietin chu mipui le khopuilien ulienngei hah bâiinkhamin an om zoia. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Khopui ulienngeiin Jason le a champuingei hah sum anâng dôr an pêka, an mojôk ngei zoi ani.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Berea khopuia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Hanchu, iempungeiin hani jân ahongni lechu Paul le Silas hah Berea khopuia an min se ngei kelena, an tungin chu Judangei Synagog an lûta. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Ma taka mingei kai chu Thessalonika mingei nêkin chu an mulungrîl ân ong uola. Thurchi hah atui takin an rangâia, Paul thurchi misîr hah adik le dikloi rietna rangin nîngtin Pathien lekhabu an inchu ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Ha ngei lâia mi tamtakin an iem zoia, Greek nupang mirit om tamtak le pasal tamtak khomin an iem zoi. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Hannirese Thessalonika Judangei han, Paul'n Berea khopuia khom Pathien thurchi a misîr ti an riet lechu mahan khom an va sea, mipuingei an mohôka; bâi an inkhâm char zoi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Iempungeiin tuipui dênin se rangin Paul hah an tîra, Silas le Timothy chu an la oma. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Paul juong thak ngei han Athens dênin an juong thaka; Silas le Timothy kôm han innota a kôma se ranga Paul chongbê chôiin an kîr nôk zoi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Athens khopuia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Paul'n Athens taka anni hah a lei ngâk lâiin ha khopuilien hah mirmilngeia sip ani ti a mûn chu a mulung a minna oka. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Masikin Synagog'a Judangei le Jentailngei, Pathien biek ngei hah a dem ngâia; mipui intûpna muna khom mataka omngei ngân chu nîngtin an injêk ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Epicurean le Stoic minchupungei lâia khomin an inkhalpuia. Senkhat chu, “Hi mûr thiempa hin imo misîr rang a bôk hi?” an tia. Adangngeiin chu, “Ram dang pathienngei chong a misîr rang ani hi,” Paul, Jisua le inthoinôkna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jisua le inthoinôkna: </char><char style="ft">Greek chongin nupang rokôknân chu, “inthoinôkna” hi pathien nupang ngei riming riet thei ani. </char></note> misîr sika ani. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Masikin Paul hah a koia, roijêkna Areopagus han an tuonga; a kôm “Hi minchuna thar ni misîr ngâi hi a riet kin nuom. <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Ni misîr kin riet ngei hih la riet ngâi makme; itina mo ani a riet kin nuom,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Athens khopui mi murdi le ramdangmingei ajuong omngei khomin an zora dôn murdi neinun thar misîrna le rangâina mang an nuom sikin).<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Paul hah roijêkna Areopagus moton taka ândinga, “Nangni Athens mingei, lamtina sakhuo mi tatak nin ni ti ki riet. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Nin khopuilien sûnga ka chai malamin chubai nin mûk ngâi ngei ke ena; mâichâm inkhat, ‘Rietloi pathien ta rang,’ tia ânziek ku mua. Nin rietloi chubai nin mûk tit ngâi hah atûna nangni ki misîr pe hih ani. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24,25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Rêng 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Sin 7:48</ref></char></note> Pathien'n rammuol le asûnga neinunngei murdi sinpu chu pilchung le invân Pumapa ani sikin kuta sin in ngeia om ngâi mak. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Miriem ei sem rang neinun ite khom insam mak. Ama ngêt han hah ngei nâm kôma ringna ngei, phûk ngei le mitin kôma neinunngei nâm a pêkpu ani uol. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Rammuol pumpuia om rangin, mi inkhat renga jâttin a sina. An ta rang zorangei a khit pe ngeia, an omna rang rikung a khangpe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Ma hih a thona abi chu ama an ena, an zonga an mu theina ranga ani. Adiktakin, Pathien chu tute renga la uol mak. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Mi senkhatin an ti anghan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Ama sikin ei ringa, singinsa'n, ei om ani,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Nin lâ phuopungei khomin an ti sa anghan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Eini khom a nâingei ei ni.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Pathien nâingei ei nin chu, Pathien chu rângkachak mini, sumin mini, lungin mini, miriem kut thiem le mindonna mirimil an sin ngâi anga han om rang tetên ei bôk rang nimak. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Pathien'n ama ei riet mâna ngei kai chu rietloi om a tho ngâia; aniatachu, atûn chu ramtina mi murdi sietna renga inhei rangin chong a pêk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Nikhuo a khita, ha nia han a mi phunpu hah rammuola mi murdi ngei roi adiktakin jêk atih. Ma chong ha chu Pathien'n ama hah thina renga kaithoiin mi murdi kôm a min riet zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Thina renga inthoinôk roi an riet lechu senkhatin an munuisana; senkhat nôkin chu, “Hi chong hi no kôm renga la rangâi nôk kin nuom,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Male Paul a mâk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Mi senkhat chu a tieng an kop tita male an iem zoia. Ha ngei lâia senkhat chu, Areopagus roijêkpu pâla mi Dionysius le nupang inkhat a riming Damaris le midang ngei an ni.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Korinth khopuiliena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Masuole han, Paul hah Athens renga Korinth a se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Mahan Juda inkhat a riming Aquila a mua, ha mi hah Pontus rama suok ania, Claudius Juda murdi Rom renga jôkpai rangin chong a pêk sikin a lômnu Priscilla le Italy ram renga hong inthon bil an ni. Paul an kôm a sea. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Ha ngei khom hah Paul anga puon in sin ngâi anni sikin an kôm a oma, munkhatin sin an tho zoi. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Sabbathni racham Synagog taka chong a mintukpui ngâia. Judangei le Greekngei hah min riet minthâr rang a bôk ngâia.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Silas le Timothy Macedonia ram renga an juong tungin chu Paul hah thurchi misîr injîen a zora a mang zoia, Jisua chu Messiah ani tiin Judangei kôm a ril minthâr ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Hannirese an doia an ril minsieta masuole, chu Paul'n a puona rababngei hah thikin chongnatakin a thuona, an kôm, “Nin thina chungroi chu nangnin pêl roi, keima chu ko jôk ani, atûn renga chu Jentailngei kôm se ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Masikin a jôka Jentail inkhat a riming Titius Justus ina a lûta, ha mi hah Pathien biek ngâi mi ania, a in khom Synagog le ântôn chak. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Crispus Synagog ruoipu han a inmingei murdi le Pumapa an iema, Korinth khopuia mi tamtak khomin an rieta, an iema baptisma an chang zoi.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Jân khat chu Paul'n inlârna a mua, mahan Pumapa'n a kôm, “Chi no roh, dâirek loiin thurchi misîr tit roh, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>asikchu nang ko ompui tit nang minna rangin tutên nu chunga an kut musum noni ngei, hi khopuia hin mi tamtak ko dôn kêng,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Masik han, Paul hah ma khopuiliena han Pathien chong minchûn kum khat in-ang a oma.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Gallio ha Achaia rama râiôt a chang lâiin Judangei an inruola, Paul an sûra, roijêknamuna an tuonga. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>“Hi mi hin balam niloia Pathien biek rangin mi methêm rang a bôk ngâi,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Paul hong chong rang a ti lehan, Gallio han Judangei kôm, “Judangei, mahi neinun dikloi mini, aninônchu tho minchâina mini luo nirese chu, inkhêl loiin nangni mindon pe ki tih. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Hannirese, chongngei, rimingngei le nin balam chungroia inkhalna papai kêng ania, nangnin jêk roi. Kei chu ha anga neinunngei kai chu jêk no ning,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Roijêkna mun renga a rujûlpai ngei zoia. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Anrêngin an Synagog ruoipu Sosthenes an sûra, roijêknamun mâia an jêma. Aniatachu Gallio han ma anga an tho ha itên rangâi pe ngei tet mak.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Antioch a kîr nôkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Tel 6:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Masuole han Paul hah iempungei leh sûn tamtak a la oma, hanchu iempungei hah a mathân ngeia Syria ram tieng rukuongin a se zoia, a kôm Priscilla le Aquila khom an se sa. Paul'n chonginkhâm a lei dôn sikin Cenchreae a se mân a sam a ep baka. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Ephesus'a an tunga, mahan Priscilla le Aquila chu a mâka, ama chu Synagog taka a lûta Judangei hah chong a la mintukpui ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Anni han asôtzan om rangin an ngêna, hannirese pom pe ngei maka. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Manêkin, an kôm se khom inlang “Pathien lungdo anîn chu nin kôm la hong nôk ki tih,” tiin chong hoiin a mâk ngeia, Ephesus'a renga rukuongin a se zoia.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Caesarea a tungin chu Jerusalema a sea, koiindang chibai a mûka, masuole chu Antioch taka a se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Mahan sûn tamtak a om suo nûkin a se nôka, iempungei mindet tîrin Galatia ram le Phragia ram a sir suo zoi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus'a le Korinth taka Apollos thurchi a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Ha lâia han Juda inkhat a riming Apollos, Alexandria taka suok Ephesus'a a juonga. Ama hah thurchi misîr theitak ania, Pathien Lekhabungei khom a riet oka. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Ama hah Pumapa lampui chong ânchu zoisai ania, mulungrîla satna tak inheiin Jisua thurchi a misîr ngâia, Nikhomrese, John baptisma vai kêng ala riet. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Synagog taka hâitakin thurchi misîr a phuta, hanchu Priscilla le Aquila hah a thurchi misîr an rietin chu an ina an tuonga, a kôm, Pathien lampui roi adik uolin an rilminthâr pea. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Hanchu ama hah Achaia rama se rang a bôk sikin Ephesus'a iempungeiin an mohôka ama an lei modômna rangin Achaia rama iempungei kôm lekha an miziek pea. A tungin chu Pathien moroina sika iempu hong chang ngei ta rangin a sanpu satak a changa. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Loko rieta Judangei hah a makhal mindoka, Pathien lekhabu mangin Jisua chu Messiah ani ti a minlang ngâi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ephesus'a Paul thurchi misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Apollos hah Korinth taka a la om lâiin Paul'n sak tienga biel a hong sîra, Ephesus'a a tunga mahan ruoisingei senkhat a mua. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Ama han, “Iempu nin changa han Ratha Inthieng nin lei modôm ngâi mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">“Ratha Inthieng aom ti luo riet mak me,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Asa! “Nônchu, khoi baptisma mo nin chang?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Anni han “John baptisma,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk 3:4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Joh 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char>
    </note> Paul'n an kôm, “John'n mingei kôm, ku nûka juong rangpu Jisua nin la iem rang ani tiin Isrealngei an sietna renga inhei ngei hah a baptis ngâi ani ha,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Maha an rietin chu Pumapa Jisua rimingin baptisma an chang zoia. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Paul'n an chunga a kut a minngama, Ratha Inthieng an chang kelen zoi, rietloi chong ngeiin an chonga, Pathien chong an misîr zoi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Anrêngin pasal sômleinik dôr an ni.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Paul'n Synagog lût bangin than thum chu Pathien Rêngram thurchi mintukpuiin methêm mene rang bôkin hâitakin thurchi a misîr tita. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Aniatachu, senkhat chu an seletrûka, iem nuom mak ngeia, mipui makunga Pumapa lampui thurchi hah an ril minsieta, masikin Paul'n anni ngei hah mâkin iempungei hah a tuonga nîngtin Tyrannus inchuna ina han chong an mintukpui ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Ma anghan, kumnik a thoa, masikin Asia rama om murdi, Judangei le Greekngei khomin Pumapa chong an riet zoia.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sceva nâingei thurchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Pathien'n Paul kuta sininkhêl adangviek a min thoa. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Paul'n a lei mang ngâi mâihuinangei le a rôpthupna puonngei hah damloingei kôm a min chôia, an natnangei an dam ngâia, an sûnga ratha saloi tena khom an jôk ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Judangei senkhat ratha saloi rujûlpai rang a bôka, ânvâk ngâi ngei khomin Pumapa Jisua riming an manga. Ratha saloi kôm, “Paul'n a misîr ngâi Jisua rimingin a sûng renga jôk rangin chong nang ke pêk,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Juda Ochai Inlaltak, Sceva han nâipasal sari ha anga chong ngâi a dôna.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Hannirese ratha saloi han an kôm, “Jisua ki riet, Paul khom ki riet nangni rêk hi chu tu ngei mo nin ni?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>A sûnga ratha saloi dôn han a hong invôra, amene ngei riei zoia, ha in renga hah popnekin le an puon chet chitin an tân riei zoi. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Ephesus'a taka om Judangei le Jentailngei murdi'n ma roi hah an rietin chu an chi sabak zoia, hanchu Pumapa Jisua riming ânthang uol zoi. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Iempu tamtak an honga, loko rieta an chong minchâina an phuonga. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Dôitheingei tamtak khomin an lekhabungei an hong bûma, mitin mitmua an hâla, male aman an minsâpa, sumdârngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sumdârngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sumdâr duli hi tângram sinthopu sûnkhat rathaman ani (Mat 20:2 en roh).</char></note> isâng sômrangnga ani tiin an rieta. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Ma ang taka sintho theina lien han Pumapa thurchi ânzara, rât takin ânsôn tir zoi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus'a a bâiinkhamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Masuole chu Paul'n Macedonia ram le Achaia ram a sir suo baka, Jerusalema se rang a bôka “Ma han ke se suole chu Rom khom sir sa ngêt ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Masikin ânsanpui ngâi mi inik, Timothy le Erastus hah Mecedonia rama a lei tîr baka, ama chu Asia rama ala oma.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Ma zora lâihan Pumapa lampui thurchi sikin bâiinkhamna lientak Ephesus'a a oma. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Mi inkhat a riming Demetrius, sumtuia Artemis pathiennu biekin rimil sin ngâi a oma, maha a sintho ngei kôm inlâpna lientak an pêk ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Masikin ama han anni ngei hah a koibûma, an sintho anga tho ngei lehan chu, an kôm, “Miriempa, hi sin hih ei neina ani ti nin rieta. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Atûn, hi Paul sintho hih nangni khomin nin mua, nin rieta Ephesus'a vaia khom niloiin Asia ram pumpuia ti rang dôrin hi mi hin, kuta sin pathienngei hih pathien ni tet mak tiin mi tamtak a huong mene suo zoia. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Masikin ei sintho hih min en minnuoi an tih, ti vai niloiin, Asia rama mi murdi le rammuola mîn an biek ngâi pathiennu Artemis roiinpui khom boi atih, ti hih ichi aom ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Ha chong hah mipuingeiin an riet lechu an taksi sabaka, “Ephesus'a Artemis hi a roiinpui tak,” tin an hêta. <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Hanchu, khopuilien pumpui bâi an inkhâm zoia, Gaius le Aristarchus, Mecedonia rama mi Paul nûkjûingei hah an sûra, a pâlin enhoi sinna ina an tânpuia. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Paul'n mipui makunga vânding rang a bôka, hannirese, iempungeiin phal mak ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Asia rama ulien senkhat Paul malngei an oma, ha ngei khom han Paul hah enhoi sinna ina vânlang loi rangin chong an muthuona. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>an thup ngeia, anrêngin bâi an inkhâm char zoia, mi tamtakin an intûpna bi khom riet mak ngei. Masikin, senkhat chong inkhat an hêtpuia senkhatin chong dang an hêtpuia. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Mi senkhat chu Alexander sika nîng atih, an tia; ama hah Judangei moton tieng an nam minlût sikin. Alexander'n mipui ruhu dâina rangin a kut a jâpa, an theina thurchi misîr rang a bôka. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Hannirese Juda ani ti an riet lechu darkâr nik inruolin, “Ephesus'a Artemus hih a roiinpui tak,” tiin an iniek tita.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Amongnataka chu an khopuilien jêkpu'n mipuingei hah a ngo mindâia. A ngo mindâi suole chu an kôm, “Ephesus'a Artimus roiinpuitak biekin le invân renga lung inthieng achul hah Ephesus'a mingei hih a donsûipu nin ni ti mitinin an rieta. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Hi chong hi tutên makhal thei noni ngei. Masikin nin ruhu mindâi ngêt rang ani, mindon bak loiin ite nin tho rang nimak. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Hi mi, hi taka nin hong tuong ngei hih biekina inru khom nimak ngeia, ei pathiennu rilminsiet khom nimak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Demetrius le a sinthongei khomin tu chunga khom roi intak an dônin chu roijêkpungei ei dôna, roijêkna in khom ân-ong tit, ma son vân ngo rese ngei. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Aniatachu, roi intak piel nin la dônin chu jâttin roijêkna ina mindon nîng atih. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Aviena inkhôm sika hin mîn bâiinkhamna musuo ngei tiin, mi tîng an tih, ti hih ichi om ani. Hi bâiinkhamna hi abi boi ani sikin tute lakin abi misîr thei noni ngeia,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Ma chong hah a ti suole chu mipuingei intûp hah an chîn zoi.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Macedonia le Achaia an se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Ruhu lumpa hah ahek suole Paul'n iempungei a koibûma, a mohôkna chongin a mâk ngeia. Hanchu a jôka Macedonia rama a se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Mingei mohôkna chong tamtak misîrin ha ram hah a sir suoa, Achaia ram a tung zoia. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Mahan than thum aom suole Syria ram tieng se rangin ânthoka; hannirese, Judangei an lei muruong chien ti a riet sikin Macedonia tieng kîr nôk rang a bôka. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Pyrrhus nâipasal Sopater Beroea mingei, Aristarchus le Secundus, Thessalonika mingei, Gaius, Derbe, mingei, Timothy ngei, Tichicus le Trophimus Asia rama mingei an se sa. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Ha ngei hah moton aninsa. Troasa min lei ngâka. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Keini chu cholboivâipôl ruolhoi chumin Philipi renga rukuongin kin jôka. Sûn rangnga suole Troasa an kôm kin tunga, mahan sûn sari kin châma.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul'n anûktaka Troas a vasir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Sûnrukni kholoiin vâipôl khoi rangin kin intûpa, Paul'n anangtûka se rang a bôk sikin jânchim tena thurchi a misîr jêta. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Kin intûpna khâltan chunginchuon han châti tamtak mochok ania. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Hanchu ruotharte inkhat a riming Eutychus, kotvênga ân sunga inngûi a lênsua Paul thurchi misîr hah asôt rai sikin a lei inphara; in chunginchuon inthumna renga a juong tâka. An juong rût tena chu a lei thi zoi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Aniatachu Paul a chuma a juon kûna a poma, “Nin mulung minjîng no roi, a la ring ke,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Hanchu, Paul hah in chunginchuona a kal nôka, vâipôl a khoia, an sâk zoia. Asôtzan khuovâr rak dôr nisa asuok tena a chongpui ngei suole chu a se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ruotharte hah damin a in tieng an tuonga an phûk adâiriem zoi.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Troas renga Miletus a se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Keini chu rukuongin Assos khuo panin moton kin lênsa zoi, mahan Paul min chuong rang kin bôka, ama hah kea hong rang a bôk sikin hi anga rangin mi ril sai ani. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Assosa mi hong huoma, kin min chuonga Mitylene kin tung zoi. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Ha mun renga hah rukuong nanâkin kin se nôka, anangtûka Chios kin tunga hatûk chu Samos kin tunga, anangtûk nôka Miletus kin tung zoia. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Paul'n Asia rama om sôt a nuom loi sikin Ephesus'a chu sûnapal rang a bôk piel ani. Ani thei paia anîn chu Jerusalema Pentecost ni mang rang a bôka, ânnot ani.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus'a Upangei kôma Paul mathâna chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Miletus renga Paul'n Ephesus'a mi a tîra, koiindang ulienngei ava min koi ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>A kôm an tungin chu an kôm, “Asia ram ku lût masa ni renga nin kôma ko om kâra ko omlam hah nin rieta. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Judangei min muruong sika mitrithi tâk pumin le zora intak ku chunga hong tung ngei tuongin intem takin Pumapa sin ko tho ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Nin ta ranga inlâpna rang ite thup loiin loko lâia le insûngngeia nangni ki ril ngâia, nangni ki minchu ngâi duo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Judangei le Jentailngei khom Pathien tieng an sietnangei renga insîrin ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista an iem rang ani ti insiemna chong ke pêk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Male atûn Ratha Inthieng chong jômin Jerusalema ke se rang ani, mahan ku chunga imo atung rang riet mu ung. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Khopuilien tina, intâng ina le bâiinkhamnân mi ngâk ti vai hi Ratha Inthiengin mi min rieta, ki riet ani. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Tim 4:7</ref></char></note> Pathien moroina Thurchi Sa misîr rang sintum Pumapa Jisua Khrista mi pêk zoina rangin chu ki ringna khom hi itên be mu-ung.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>“Masikin riet roi, nin rêngin Pathien Rêngram thurchi misîra kên vâkna ngâi ngei hin atûn renga chu mi mu khâi no tu nui, ti ki riet. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Mapêna an mang nin om duoi le khom kei chu ko jôk ani ti avien hin nangni ki min riet. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Pathien neinun khîn murdi anrêngin nin lâia misîr inrîng mu ung. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Masikin Pathien koiindang, a Nâipasal thina sika ama ta ranga a sin chunga belripungei chang ungla, nangni le belripâl Ratha Inthiengin nangni a min kolna ngei satna rang zong roi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ku nûk le chu melang ichi om ngei nin lâia hong lût an ta, belripâl hôih noni ngei ti ki riet. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Nin pâla mi senkhat khomin iempungei an tieng an tuong theina rangin milak an ril zora la tung atih. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Hanchu sûn, jân mitrithi tâkpumin kum thum piel mitin nangni ki minchu hah riettitin sing thei roi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>“Atûn hin Pathien donsûina le moroina chonga nangni ka bânga ama han nangni a sin minlien theia, Pathien'n a mingei ta ranga a khâm satvurna hah nangni a pêk thei. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Tute sumdâr khom, rângkachak khom, sil le bom khom ôi ngâi mu-ung. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Ku kutngei lehin keima le ka champuingei anâng murdi asuo ngâi ti nangni rengin nin rieta. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Lamtina sintho ranak songin le Pumapa Jisua'n, ‘Lâk nêkin pêk râisânna aom uol’ a ti hah riettitin râtloingei ei san rang ani ti nangni ki min mu ngâi,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Paul'n ha chong hah a ti suole chu, khûkinbilin an rêngin chubai a thopui ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>He hoiin an mathân zoia, anrêngin an chapa Paul hah an kuoa an tuma. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>A mêl an mu nôk khâi loi rang chong Paul'n a misîr pe ngei hah an rangâi sietna bitak ani. Masuole chu rukuong dênin an juong thak zoi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Jerusalema a se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Anni ngei le kin insen suole chu rukuong leh kin se pata Cos kin tunga anangtûka Rhodes kin tunga, tuihuol kin tung nôka ma renga hah Patara kin tung nôka. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Ma mun han rukuong inkhat Phonicia tienga se rang kin mua, mahan kin chuonga kin se nôk kelena. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Cyprus tuihuol ânlangna mun ten kin va phâk lehan Cyprus hah voi tieng kin mâka Syria tieng kin sea Tyre chu neinun an musum sikin kin chuma. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Ma mun han iempungei senkhat kin va mua an kôm sûn sari nikhuo kin châma, anni ngei han Ratha Inthieng rilin Paul hah Jerusalema se loi rangin an khapa. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Hannirese, sûn sari ahek suole chu ha renga hah kin jôka kin se nôka iempungeiin an lômnungei le an nâingei le tuikôl tena min juong thaka ma mun han khûkinbilin chubai kin thoa. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Masuole chu chonghoiin inkhat le inkhat kin insena rukuonga kin chuonga anni ngei chu in tieng an kîr nôk zoi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Rukuong leh kin se pata Tyre renga Tolemais kin tunga iempungei chibai kin pêka mahan sûn khat an kôm kin châma. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Sin 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char></note> Anangtûka chu kin se nôka Caesarea kin tunga mahan Thurchi Sa misîrpu Philip ina kin tunga, Philip hah Jerusalema sanpu ânthang sari ngei lâia inkhat hah alei ni. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Ama han nâi dôngmate inneiloi minli a dôna anni ngei han Pathien thurchi an misîr ngâia. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Sin 11:28</ref></char></note> Mahan sûn tamtak nikhuo kin châma ha nikhuo kin châm sûng han Judea ram renga dêipu a riming Agabus a juonga. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Kin kôm a honga Paul a kongkhitngei hah a lâka, a kengei a kutngei athenin a khita masuole chu kin kôm hi anghin a tia, “Jerusalema, Judangei hi anga kongkhit a dônpu tak hi, hi angtak hin khit an ta, Jentailngei kuta an pêk rang ti hi Ratha Inthiengin mi ril sai ke ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Ha thurchi hah kin riet lechu keini le ma khuoa omngei han Paul hah Jerusalema se loi rang kin tipe tita. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Hannirese Paul han kin kôm, “Khoimo nin tho, ma angdôr hih nin chap, ku mulung nin khoi hi? Pumapa Jisua sikin Jerusalema khit rang vai hi kên phal nimaka, thi rang ten khom kên phal ke,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Methêm theijât ani khâiloi sikin, “Pumapa ti lam tak nirese,” kin tia, kin mojôk zoi.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Masuole chu, kin insiema Jerusalem tienga se rangin kin jôk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Caeserea khuo renga ruoisi senkhat ngeiin min jûia, anni ngei lâia mi inkhat a riming Mnason, ruoisi masa ngei lâia mi Cyprus tuihuola om ngâi ama han kin tungna rang ina mi sepui zoi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul'n Jacob a vapan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Jerusalem kin tungin chu iempungeiin râisântakin min lei dona. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Anangtûka chu Paul'n Jacob ina mi sepuia ma mun han koiindang upangei murdi khom an oma. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Anni ngei hah Paul'n chibai a pêk suole chu Pathien'n a ranak a minsila Jentailngei lâia sin a tho lam ngei hah anrêngin a misîr pe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Ha thurchi hah an rietin chu anrêngin Pathien an minpâka, Hanchu Paul kôm, “Sungsuokpa, Judangei lâia iempungei tamlam le Balama an inpêk lam ngei nu mua. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Nangman Jentailngei rama Juda omngei murdi kôm, Moses balam nûksonga an nâingei sertan khâiloi rang le Juda balam jûi khâiloi rang ni minchu ngâi ti mîn an rila. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>No hong tung ti laka hi an riet ngêt rang ania, kho angin mo ei tho rang? <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23,24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Tel 6:13-21</ref></char></note> Masikin chong nang kin be lam angtakin tho roh, chonginkhâmna lei dôn sai mi pasal minli an oma. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Anni ngei hah tuong inla, an kôm nang khom inthieng inla an sam epna man hah nangman pêk roh, male chu mingei murdi'n nu thurchi an lei misîr ha dik mak ti hong riet thei an tih, nangma ke Moses balam ajûi mindik ti hong riet kelen an tih. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Sin 15:29</ref></char></note> Jentailngei lâia iempungei rangin chu, mirmil biekna sâ inthiengloi ngei, sâ alei thi sai ngei, ha renga athi ngei sâkloi rang le, hur inditna ngei khoma inthieng rang ani tiin lekha'n ei roijêk ei min riet zoi,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Masikin Paul'n anangtûka chu pasal minli ngei hah a tuonga an kôm ama khom ânthienga Pathien Biekina an lûta, inthiengna nikhuo ahek suomân chu inbôlna rang sângei pêk thei ni noni tiin ochai'n a lei ril ira.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Biekina an sûr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Aniatachu sûn sari ahek suo vâng dôrin Asia rama Judangei Paul hah Biekina an mua lokongei an misieta Paul hah an sûra. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>An hêtsana, “Israel mingei mi san roi, ma miriem hih ramtina mingei murdi kôm, Israel mingei Moses Balamngei ma Biekin ngei hi a rilminsiet bang ngâipu hah ani, atûn reng hin khom ma Biekina hin Jentailngei a hong tuonga ma Biekin hih a min nim,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Sin 20:4</ref></char></note>(Ma anga an tina chu moton han khopuilien sûnga Ephesus'a renga Trophimus hah Paul kôm an mua, Biekin sûnga a tuong nîng atih, tiin an iem sikin).<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>A khopuilien pumpui an injêl sabak zoia lokongei hah an tama, Paul ha an sûra Biekin renga an mojôk paia Biekin ngei an khâr kelen zoia. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Paul hah that rang an ti lâitakin Jerusalema mingei murdi an injêl ti Rom râlmi ulientak kôm an hong rila. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Masuole chu, râlmi pâl ulientakpu han râlmi ulienngei le râlmingei hah a tuonga lokongei tieng an tân kelena, lokongei han, râlmi ulientak le râlmingei ha an mu lechu Paul an lei jêm hah an inngama. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Hanchu, râlmi ulientak han a kôm a hong nâia, Paul hah a sûra a kuta zingjirûi inik a minbun kelena, masuole chu lokongei kôm han tumo ani le imo a tho minchâi a rekela. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Lokongei an chong inruol khâi maka, pâl dadangin an chong hah ahong om zoia, lokongei an hêtsan rei sikin khoite mindik thei maka Paul hah kulpuia minlût rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Paul hah kalbi a phâk vâng dôr an tuonga, lokongei an pût rei sikin râlmingei han a domin an dom paia. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Lokongei han “That roi” tia hêtsan chungin an jûi ngei bang.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul adikna thurchi a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Hanchu, Paul han kulpui an minlût rangto han, râlmi ulientak kôm han “No kôm chong imakhat ti thei ning mo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Râlmi ulientak han, “Greek chong ni riet mo?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>“Tiena misaloi mi thata isâng minli ramchâr tienga tuong, Egypt mi hah nimak che mo?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Paul'n “Juda, Cilicia rama Tarsus khopuiliena suok ki nia, khuo kâm omtak mi ki ni, rangâihoitakin lokongei makunga hin chong thei rangin ni phal roh,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Male chu râlmi ulientak han chong thei rangin phalna a pêka Paul hah indingna mun han a vândinga, lokongei hah dâirek rangin kut a jâpa lokongei rahang adâi lehan Hebrew chongin a chonga:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>“Ka champui Isrealngei ki dikna thurchi nin kôm ki ril hih rangâi roi!” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Hebrew chongin a chong ti an riet lechu an dâirek uol zoia Paul'n a ti banga.<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Sin 5:34-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hanchu Paul'n, “Juda ki ni, Cilicia rama Tarsus khuoa suok ki ni, hannirese Jerusalema Gamaliel minchuna hong seilien ki nia, ei richibulngei anga balam inngartaka lei inchu ki ni. Aviensûn hin nangni ngei angtaka Pathien tienga theidôra inpêk ke lei ni. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Sin 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> Hi Lampui lei jûingei hih that rang dôra lei pûta ku nuom lei lo ngâi ki ni, pasal nupang ku sûra intâng ina lei khum ngâi ki ni. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Ochai Inlalngei le Roijêkpungei murdi'n ko chong hih adik ti nangni ril thei an tih, an kôm renga Damascus taka Juda champuingei sûrna rang lekha ka mana, masikin ma khuo mingei hah sûra dûkmintonga zingjirûi leh khita Jerusalema hong tuong ranga se ki nia.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul suok tharna thurchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-9">Sin 9:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>“Hanchu ke sea, Damascus khuo kôl kin phâk le sûnchimripa inningloi rengin invân renga vârin mi juong êla. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Hanchu nuoia kên leta, chong ki rieta, ‘Sual, Sual ithomo dûk mi ni mintonga?’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Keiman, ‘Pumapa Tumo ni ni?’ tiin ke rekela, ama han ko kôm, ‘Keima Nazareth Jisua, dûk ni mintong ngâipu hah ki ni,’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Ko kôla miriemngei han vâr chu an mua, hannirese ko kôma chong juong tung hah chu riet mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Keiman ‘Pumapa imo ko tho rang?’ ki tia, Pumapa han ko kôm ‘Inthoi inla Damascus khuo lût roh, mahan Pathien'n no tho rang ngei murdi nang lei ril atih’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Avâr hah avâr rai sikin ki mitngei khom ajînga, masikin ka champuingei han ku kutin min keiruoia Damascus khuoa kin lût zoi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>“Ma khopuilien han mi inkhat a riming Ananias, Pathien biek mi le balam lei jûi ngâi a oma, mataka Juda omngei murdi'n an mirit sabaka. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Ama hah ko kôm a honga, ko kôla ândinga, Lâibung Saul hong mu thei ta roh, mi tia. Ma zora tak han ko hong muthei nôk zoia, ama hah ko hong ena. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Ama han, ei richibulngei Pathien lungdo ngei riet rang le mi diktak tîrlâm hah mua, a chongbâingei riet rangin nang a thang ani. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Nu mu le ni riet ngei angtak han mi murdi chunga rietpuipu na la ni rang sikin. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Atûn reng, hi hin khoi mo na la ôt bang? Inthoi inla, baptisma chang inla ni sietnangei rusûk minsâina rangin a kôm chubaitho ta roh, a tia.<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Jentailngei kôm koiin aom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>“Jerusalem tieng ki kîr nôka, Biekina Pathien kôm chubai ko tho lâiin inlârnân, <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Mahan Pumapa ku mua, ko kôm, ‘Inrangin Jerusalem mâk roh, ku thurchi ni misîr rang, hi muna mingeiin an modôm loi rang sikin’ a tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Hanchu keiman, ‘Pumapa, synagog murdi ngei lûta nang iempungei lei sûra lei jêm ngâipu hah ki ni tiin min riet let kêng alei ni. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Sin 7:58</ref></char></note> Male no chong rietpuipu Stephan an that zora han khom ko oma, an that rang hah asa lei ti puipu le ama that ngei an puonngei lei dar pepu hah ki ni,’ ki tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Pumapa'n, ‘Se roh, alataka Jentailngei kôm nang tîr ki tih,’” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Hanchu, ha thurchi ten hah an rangâia, masuole chu rôl inringtakin an inieka minboi pai roi! That roi! a ring rangin chuk mak an tia. <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Anrêngin an inieka an puonngei an vôka, pildi invân tieng an vôra. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Hanchu Rom râlmi ulientakpu han Paul hah rukulpui sûng tieng ruoi rangin chong a pêka, a chunga ma angdôra an hêtsana abi riet theina rangin jêm pumin rekel tit rangin a ti pe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Hannirese jêm ranga an khit suole chu, Paul'n a kôma inding râlmi razakhat ruoipu kôm han, “Rom mi adik loina khoite boi hih jêm rangin balam ani mo?” a tipea.<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Râlmi razakhat ruoipu han ha chong hah a rietin chu, râlmi ulientak kôm a sea. “Khoimo tho rang nin ti hi? Ma miriem hih Rom mi ke ani” a tipea.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Masuole chu, râlmi ulientakpu hah Paul kôm a sea, “Rom mi ni ni mo, mi ril roh!” tiin a rekela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paul'n “Ki ni,” a tiin a thuona.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Râlmi ulientakpu han “Kei chu Rom mi changna rang hin sum tamtak ka thâm ok,” a tia,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Aniatachu Paul'n kei chu “Rom mi nisai piela juonzir ki ni,” tiin athuona.<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Voikhat rengin, Paul kôma chong rekel rang dônpu ngei murdi khom an rot let zoia. Râlmi ulientak ha khom Paul hah Rom mi ani ti a riet lechu asân a chi zoi, moton han Paul ha zingjirûi leh a lei thung zoi sikin.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Roijêkpungei makunga Paul ânding</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Hanchu, anangtûka chu râlmi ulien han, Judangei itho sikin mo Paul an nônna riet rang a nuom sikin, a zingjirûi khitna an sût pea, ochaisingei le roijêkpungei murdi lei intûp rangin chong a pêka, masuole chu Paul ha a tuonga an makunga a minding zoi.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Paul'n roijêkpungei hah a en ngita, “Ka champui Isrealngei aviensûn ten hin Pathien mâkunga sielesarietna diktak dônin ko tho rang ngei murdi ko hong tho ani,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Ochai Inlaltak Ananias han, Paul kôma inding ngei kôm han Paul hah a bâikuo bên pe roi, a ti pe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mat 23:27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref></char></note> Paul'n a kôm, “Nangma, bang rusûk minchekpu Pathien'n nang bên atih, a tia. Mahan nên sunga Balam anga roijêk rangin nên sunga balam khêlin mi min bên rang ni ti mo!” a tipea.<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Paul kôm inding ngei han, Paul kôm han “Pathien Ochai Inlaltak khom jâ loiin khoi ithomo no ngo,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Jôk 22:28</ref> </char>
    </note> Paul'n “Ka champuingei Ochai Inlaltak ani ti ki riet loi sika kêng, Pathien lekhabu'n ‘Ni mi, roijêkpungei chunga chong saloi ni ti rang nimak ati,’” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Sin 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phili 3:5</ref></char>
    </note> Paul'n Sadduceengei senkhat, Pharisee ngei senkhat le anni ti a riet lechu, roijêkpungei lâia han inringtakin “Ka champui Isrealngei keima Pharisee ki ni, Pharisee nâipasal ki ni, keiman mithi inthoinôkna aom ti sabeina ko dôn sikin ma angtaka intakna ko om ani,” a ti pe ngeia.<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Maha a ti suole chu, Pharisee ngei le Sadduceengei bâiinkhamin pâl inikin an insena. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mk 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk 20:27</ref></char></note> (Sadduceengeiin chu mithi inthoinôkna reng om mak, vântîrtonngei, rathangei ommak, aniatachu Pharisee ngeiin chu anin thumin an iem sikin.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Hanchu an iniek hah ânring uola, Pharisee tienga Balam minchupungei senkhat an indinga asân an makhala, “Hi miriem hih a tho minchâina khoite mu mak me, vântîrton le ratha'n a chongpui tatak khom nisenla khoimo asiet?” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Hanchu asân an inkhal sikin Paul hah khêr nôinek ni ngei tiin râlmi ulientak han a chia, râlmingei hah lokongei lâia han juong sea, Paul hah hong tuonga kulpui sûng tieng tuong pai rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="ACT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Mani jân han Pumapa hah, Paul kôm a juon dinga, a kôm, “Chi no roh! Jerusalema ko chong ni min riet angdên han Rom khopuia khom ko chong la min riet nôk ni tih,” a tipea.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul that rang huongvâr an phan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Anangtûk jînga chu Juda senkhatngei an intûpkhôma, huongvâr an sina Paul an that mân chu ite sâkloi rang nêkloi rang tiin khomâk an insâma. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Ma anga tho ngei hi mi sômminli nêkin an tama. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Hanchu anni ngei hah ochaisingei le upangei kôm an sea, “Paul kin that mân chu ite sâkloi rang nêkloi rangin khomâk kin insâm ke ani zoi. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Masikin atûn hin, nangnin roijêkpungei le a roi asa uola jêk rang angin Paul hi nin kôm juong tuong rangin Rom râlmi ulientak kôm chong hong pêk roi, nin kôm a juong tung mân khom lei that rangin kin insiem suo ke ani zoi,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Hannirese ma thurchingei hah Paul a tupa'n a lei rieta, kulpui sûnga a va lûta, Paul a va rîla. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Hanchu Paul han râlmi razakhat ruoipu inkhat a koia, “Hi ruotharte hi râlmi ulientak kôm tuong roh, râlmi ulientak kôma chong khat ril rang a dôn,” a tipea. <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Râlmi ulientakpu kôm a tuonga, “Intâng ina ompu Paul han mi koia hi ruotharte hi no kôm hong thak rangin mi tia, no kôm hin chong inkhat ril rang a dôn tiin chong mi be sa,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Râlmi ulientak han a kut a sûra, mun ânkilna uola a tuonga “Imo mi ril rang no dôn,” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Ama han, “Juda rachamneipungei Paul a roi hi adik uola jêk rang tiin nangtûka roijêkpungei kôma tuong rang minlêmin nang an hong zong rang ani. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Hannirese an chong lei don no roh, an lâia mi sômminli nêka tam uolin Paul an that mân chu ite sâkloi rang nêkloi rang tiin chong an inkhâm, atûn hin that rangin an insiem chak kêng ani zoi no chong vai ke an ngâk,” a tipea.<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Râlmi ulientak han, “Hi thurchi hi ko kôma ni misîr pêna chu tute kôm misîr khâi no roh,” tiin chong a bea. Male ruotharte hah a min se zoi.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul hah râiôt Felix kôm an tîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Hanchu, “Râlmi razanik ruoipu inik a kôia, avien jân, dârkuo dôrin Caesarea se rangin râlmi razanik le, sakor chung chuong thei sômsari le isei a chôi râlmi razanik insiem roi, <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Mapêna han Felix kôm a tung ngêt theina rangin, Paul a chuongna rang sakorngei khom mintuo pe sa rangin chong a be sa zoi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Male Râlmi ulienpu han, hi anghin lekhamuthuon a mizieka. <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>“Claudius Lysias Râiôt jâ omtak Felix: chibai a pêk. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Hi miriem hih Judangei an sûra, that rang an ti lâitakin ka râlmingei juong kêlsuo rangin ke sea, Rom mi ani ti ki riet sikin ko hong sanminjôka. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>An nônna bi riet rang ku nuom sikin, an roijêkpungei kôm khom ku tuonga. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Anni an balama a lekti sikin an nôn pai ani ti ki rieta, hannirese thi rak rang dôr le intâng ina omna rang dôr ite minchâi mak. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Male Judangei that rangin an pût tit ti min rîla, masikin no kôm ku juongtîr kelen ani. A nônpungei khom a thurchi misîr rang a nônpungei murdi chu no kôm hong misîr rangin chong ke pêk ngei,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Hanchu râlmingeiin a chongpêk angin Paul hah an tuonga mani jân han Antipatris khuo an tungpuia. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Anangtûka chu râlmi kea se ngei hah chu rukulpui tieng an kîr nôka, sakor chunga chuong mingei vai hah Paul sepui tit rangin an oma. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Hanchu Caesarea an tuonga, Râiôt kôm lekha hah an pêka, male Paul ha khom a kuta an bang kelena. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Râiôt'n lekha hah a pore suole chu Paul omna ram a rekela, Cililia ram mi ani ti a riet lechu a kôm, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>“Nang nônpungei an juong tung lehan no roi hih keiman rangâi ki tih,” a tipea. Hanchu Paul hah râiôt omna munpuia han dara vêng bang rangin chong a pêk ngeia.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Judangei Paul an nônna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Sûn rangnga suole Ochai Inlaltak Ananias hah upangei senkhat le balamtheipu a riming Tertullas ngei le Ceasarea khuoa an sea. Felix makunga an vânlanga male Paul an nônna roi hah an va rila. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Hanchu Paul hah an koi lûta, male Tertullus'n hi anghin an nônna roi a hong misîr phuta:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Nasa sabak na! No roijêk theina jârin inngêi takin zora sôtak kin om ngâi sik le kin ram sana rang sinsiem anângngei murdi khom nangman mi ni thop sikin. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Kho zora khoma, kho muna khom râisântakin kin om ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>No zora minchâi ok rang hi jôt mu ung han khom nu nunhoina sikin ko chong bongkik hi mi lei rangâi pe rangin nang ko hong ngên. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Ma miriem hin asân mi min jêla; muntina Judangei lâia injêlnangei a musuok phuta Nazareth pâla ruoipu inkhat ani ti kin riet. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Pathien Biekin min nim rangin a tho ngâi sikin kin lei sûr ania, kin balam angin a roi hih jêk kin nuoma. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Hannisenla, râlmi ulientak Lysias a honga, male rangrât rengin kin kôm renga a tuonga. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Ama nônpungei khom na makunga inlang rangin chong a pêk sa, nangma reng khomin rekel inla, kin nônna bi ngei hi ama renga khom hin riet thei ni tih,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Judangei khomin an nônna an lei thopa ma ngei murdi hah adik kêng an lei tia.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Felix makunga Paul'n adikna roi a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Masuole chu râiôt'n Paul hah chong rangin kut jâpin a kôia, Paul'n,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Kum tamtak hi jât nget chunga roijêkpu ne lei ni ti ki riet sikin asân ka râiasâna, râisântakin na makunga hin ki dikna thurchi ki misîr rang ani, a tia. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Jerusalema Pathien biek rangin ko hong se ni renga hi sûn sômleinik pên lani nonih ti nangma rengin riet thei ni tih. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Pathien Biekina tute kên khal puina omak, Synagogngeia le khopuiliena, kho mun khoma, Mipuingei saloi tho ranga ki misietna Judangei mu mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Atûna no kôma min juong nônna hi khom inthâr takin misîr thei no ni ngei. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Nikhomrese hi chong hih no kôm muphuong ki tih: Anni ngeiin minchuna dikloi an lei ti ngâi lam dang tieng ei richibulngei Pathien ke lei jûia, hannirese Moses Balama lênziek le dêipungei lekhabungei murdi chu ke lei iem ani. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Keima khom anni ngei angin Pathiena sabeina ko dôn, mi murdi ngei, midik le dikloi, thina renga inthoinôkna ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Masikin Pathien le miriem makunga hin sielesarietna diktak hih kho zora khom dôn tit rang hih ke lei nuom tak ani.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17,18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Sin 21:17-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Kum tamtak Jerusalem ka mâk suo nûkin, ka jât mingei rang sum le inbôlnangei pêk rangin ke sea. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Ma zora han inthiengna ko dôn suole Biekina min mua, ma zora han mipuingei khom ommak ngeia ite rahang a rât khom om mak. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Hannirese, Asia rama Judangei senkhatngei mahan an oma; anni ngei han min nônna thurchi hin imo misîr rang an dônin chu, no kôm hin juong misîr rese ngei. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Nônchu ma muna mingei hin roijêkpungei makunga kên ding zora han imo ki minchâina an man misîr rese ngei. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Sin 23:6</ref></char></note>Hi neinun inkhat an makunga kên ding lâia ki ti telloiin chu: ‘Mithi inthoinôkna aom tiin iemna ko dôn ti hi aviensûn ten hin hi angtaka dûktonga ko omna chu ani.’ ” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Hanchu Felix hah, ma roi hah asadima lei min riet ani sikin, roijêkna hah a minngama, “Râlmi ulientak Lysias a juong tung tena nin roi hi la jêk rong,” a ti pe ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Hanchu Paul a rungpu ulientak kôm han asadima enkôl rangin chong a pêka, aniatachu alekti mojôk rangin le a malngei anângngei pêk thei rangin phalna a pêka.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Felix le Drusilla makunga Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Sûn idôr mini suole Felix le a lômnu Drusilla, Juda nupang leh an honga. Paul hah an kôia Jisua Khrista taksônna roia an chonga, a thurchi hah an rangâia. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Paul'n dikna ngei, indînna, male roijêk nikhuo ahong tung rang ngei, a misîr pea anînchu Felix han asân a chia, “Atûn chu ne se thei zoi. Zora ka man tika nang koi nôk ki tih,” a tipea. <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ma zoratak han Paul'n sum mi pêk duoi mo ti sabeina a dôna; masika han a kôia a chongpui bang ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Kum inik dôr a vunsuo lechu, Porcius Festus, Felix hah râiôt'n a thûl zoia. Felix han Judangei modômna man rang a nuom sikin Paul ha intâng ina a mâk chiena.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Paul'n Caesar kôm tung rang a nuom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Hanchu Festus'n ha ramhuol hah a tunga, sûnthum suole chu Caesarea renga Jerusalema a sea. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Mahan ochaisingei le Juda ruoipungeiin Paul hah an hong tuonga an nônna Festus kôm han an ngêna <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>an nuomna thope ngeia Paul hah Jerusalema hong tuong rangin, asikchu lampuia lei that rang an bôk sikin. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Festus a thuona, “Paul hi Caesarea intâng ina lei dar ania male keima khom mason se nôk lei rang ki ni. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Nin ruoipungei Caesarea tena mi jûi senla ngei ma miriem hah a tho lei minchâina aomin chu juong nôn rese ngei,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Festus hah sûn riet mini, sûn sôm mini, anni ngei leh ala châma male Caesarea tieng a se zoi. Anangtûka chu roijêkna ânsunga Paul hah hong tuong rangin chong a pêka. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Paul hah a hong tung lechu a kôm han Jerusalem renga juong Judangei hah a rihîla an indinga an nônna thurchi tamtak an misîra, minthârna man mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Aniatachu Paul han athenin ânrunga: “Judangei balam roia, Biekin roia nônchu Caesar chunga khom ite minchâiin doina lei tho mu-ung,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Hannirese Festus han Judangei modômna man rang a nuomna, masikin Paul kôm han a rekela, “Jerusalema sea, ka makunga nang an nônna ngei hih khi taka hôn jêk rang nu nuom mo?” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Paul'n, “Caesar roijêkna makunga ko roi an jêkna muna jêk pea om rang piela inding ki ni. Judangei chunga ite minchâina dôn mu ung ti nangma khom ni riet sai ania. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Balam ki minchâia, thi rang dôrin minchâina ko dôn anîn chu, thi rang khomin kên phal. Hannirese min nônna ngei hi adikloi anin chu tutên an kôm mi pêk thei no ni ngei Caesar kôm tung ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Hanchu Festus roijêkpungei, a chongpui suole chu, “Caesar kôm tung rang nu nuom lam angtakin tung ni tih,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Agrippa le Bernice makunga Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Sûn idôr mini avun suole chu Rêng Agrippa le Bernice Caesarea an hong tunga Festus mirit an pêka. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Sûn tamtak an om nûkin, Festus'n Paul thurchi ngei hah Rêng kôm han a misîr pea Felix han mi inkhat intâng ina hin a mâka. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Jerusalema ke sea han, Juda Ochaisingei le Juda ruoipungeiin asân an lei nônna dikloi minchang ngêt rangin ko kôm an ngêna. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Aniatachu hi anghin ki tipe ngei, “An nônpu le a nônpungei mâi intongin, an nônpu han an nônna roia han a dikna thurchi misîr rang a riet khâi noa, dikloi ani ti ânlang mân chu mojôk rang hih Rom mingei balam nimak. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Mahin an juong tung suo nûkin zora sôtloiin anangtûka roijêkna taka kên sunga, ama hah hong tuong rangin chong ke pêka. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>A nônpungei hah an indinga, aniatachu Paul chunga han ma dôra dikloina khoite an misîr angin riet mu-ung. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>An inkhalnangei senkhat ha chu sakhuo roia ania mi inkhat a riming Jisua an ti, ama hah a thia; aniatachu Paul'n ama hah aring nôk a tia. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Keiman chu ma thurchi ngei ha chu a jêkna chang khom riet mu-ung, masikin keiman Paul ke rekela Jerusalema a sea mahan ajêk rangin nu nuom mo? tiin ke rekela. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Aniatachu Paul han Caesar jêk pe rangin a ngên sikin, ki min se thei mân chu lei donsûi rangin chong ke pêk ngei ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agrippa han Festus kôm, “Kei khom ma miriem hah a chong rangâi rang ku nuom,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festus'n “Nangtûka rangâi ni tih,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Anangtûka chu Agrippa le Bernice han inlal takin mipuingei intûpna an va lûta, râlmi ulienngei le khopuilien sûnga ulienngei khom an oma. Hanchu Festus chongpêkin Paul an hong tuonga. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Festus han, “Rêng Agrippa le kin kôma omngei murdi, hi mi hih nin mu ania, Judangei murdi'n hi taka omngei le Jerusalema omngei murdi'n ko kôm an juong nônna min ring khâiloi rangin an in-iek. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Hannisenla thina rang dôr ite tho minchâina dôn mak ti ki rieta. Aniatachu ama'n Ceasar kôm tung rang a nuom sikin tîr rangin ki ti ani. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Aniatachu, a thurchi hi Ceasar kôm ki miziek rang hi ânthârin riet mu-ung, masikin nin kôm ko hong tuong ani hi, Rêng Agrippa nangma kôm hin ani uol, a chungroi nin phuol suole, a miziek rang imakhat ko dôn thei rang. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Asikchu mi intâng ina om, an nônna bi inthârlaka ril loia tîr rang chu keima rangin omzie boi aphuo rang,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Agrippa makunga adikna thurchi a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agrippa'n Paul kôma, “Ni dikna thurchi misîr thei rangin phal ni nih,” a tipea. Paul'n a kut a phara a dikna thurchi, hi anghin a misîra:<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Rêng Agrippa! Judangei min nônna murdia ki dikna thurchi avien hin no kôm ki misîr rang sikin asân ka râlvân asa okin ki riet, <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>mahin, Judangei balam le ânjêlna omngei murdi ni riet minthâr sikin rangâihoitakin ko chong hi ni lei rangâi pe rangin nang ko hong ngên ani.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Judangei murdi'n nâipang ka chang lâia ko omlam le ku nunchan, motona kin rama, masuole Jerusalema khom an rêngin an riet. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>An misîr nuom ngânin chu, ku thurchi hi aphut renga an riet let, ei sakhuo tienga pâl inngartak Pharisee ngei lâia ke lei omngei hah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Sin 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phili 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Male atûn ei richibulngei kôm Pathien chong a lei khâmsai hah sabeina sikin hima mun hin kên ding ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Ma chonginkhâm sika han ei jât sômleinik ngeiin sûn le jânin Pathien chubai an lei mûk ngâi ani, male ma sabeina sika han Pumapa, hima sikin kêng Judangei hin min nôn ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Pathien'n mithi a kaithoi ngei thei ani, tiin hi taka omngei hin ithomo nin iem theiloi?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Sin 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> “Keima nanâk khom hih Nazareth Jisua riming doiin neinunngei murdi tho ngâi ke lei ni. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Maha Jerusalema ke lei tho ngâi. Ochaisingei renga rachamneina ngei ka mana, male Pathien mingei tamtak intângna ina ke lei khum ngâi; male that rang an ti zora khomin, asa ke lei ti pui ngei ngâi. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Synagogngeia khom voi tamtak dûk ke lei mintong ngei ngâi, an taksônna ngei min mâk rangin ke lei pût ngâia, ka takasi rei sikin ram dang khopuilienngei khom ku nunuom lo rangin ke se ngâi.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul'n a ringnun ânthûl a misîr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Sin 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Ma rang sik piel han ochaisingei renga rachamneina le phalna chôiin Damascus khuoa ke sea. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Pu Mirit-omtak, lampuia ke se lâitak sûnchimripa, O Rêngpa, invân renga juong vâr, nisa nêka vâr uol hah, keima le ka champuingei revêla hin ajuong êl ku mua. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Kin rêngin nuoia kin inleta, male Hebrew chongin ‘Saul, Saul! ithomo nangman nu nunuom mini loa? Nangmananâk kêng nang minna rang, serâtchalin a pumapa tôkmola doiin athâi anghan’ kêng ani rang. <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Keiman, ‘Puma tumo ni ni?’ tiin ke rekela, male Pumapa han, ‘Keima hih Jisua, dûk ni mintong bângpu hah ki ni, tiin a thuona. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Aniatachu, inthoi inla ne ke leh inding roh, ki sinthopua nang phun rangin no kôm ku juong inlâr ani. Avien sûna keima renga nu mu ngei le sûnmoton tienga nang ki min mu rang ngei murdi hi midangngei khom ril roh. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Israelngei le Jentailngei renga nang kêlsuo ki tih, nang ki tîrna rang ngei kôm renga. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>An mitngei minvâr pe ngei na ta, hanchu ijîng renga avâr tieng hong inhei an ta, soitan kut renga Pathien tieng hong inhei an tih, masikin ku chunga taksônna an dôn sika an sietnangei ngâidam an changna rang le Pathien mi thang ngei lâia mun an manna rangin.’ a tia.<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul'n a sinthongei a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Male, Rêng Agrippa, invân renga inlârna ku mu jômloiin tho mu-ung. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Sin 9:20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref></char></note> Motontaka Damascus sûnga male Jerusalem sûnga male chu Judea ram murdi le Jentailngei lâia khom, an sietnangei renga insîrin, male Pathien tieng an nin hei zoi ti riet theina rangin thurchi ki misîr pe ngâi ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Masik taka han hi Judangei Biekin sûnga ko om han min sûra, male ma that rang an pût ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Aniatachu avien sûnten hin Pathien'n ni sana, male mi chîn le mi lien ngei kôm indingin rietpuipu nina hih nin rêngin nin kôm ka la misîr thei ani, ki ti ngâi ngei chu, Moses le dêipungeiin la juong tung atih, an ti bang ngâi hah ani: <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Kor 15:20</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note> Messiah han dûktong ngêt a ta, male thina renga inthoinôk masatak nîng atih, Sanminringna vâr thurchi Judangei le Jentialngei kôm muphuong atih,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Ma anghan, Paul'n a dikna thurchi a misîr lâitakin, Festus hah a hong hêtsana, “Paul, na châng ke ani zoi! nên chu mintam rei sikin na châng zoi!” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Paul'n, châng mu-ung, Festus mirit omtak hangvangin adiktak ki misîr ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Rêng Agrippa! hâitakin no kôm ko chong thei, hi neinunngei chungroi hih ni riet sikin, hi thurchi hih inkila tho nimaka a kôm hin ite ip rang ommak ti ki riet mindik ani. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>“Rêng Agrippa dêipungei ni iem mo? ni iem ti ki riet ani!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agrippa han Paul kôm, ma zora bongte sûng hin Khristien mi min chang rang no bôk mini? a tia.<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Paul'n, “zora bongtên mo, aseiin mo, nangma vai nang ti mu unga, avien sûna ko chong rangâi ngei murdi hih keima anga om rangin Pathien kôm ke ngên bang ngâi hi zingjirûi hi chu bun uol loi rangin!” tiin athuona.<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Hanchu Rêng, le Râiôt, le Bernice, le adangngei murdi an inthoi leta, <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Male an mâk suole anni le anni a nin tia, “Hima miriem hin a thina rang dôra le intângna ina khum rang dôra minchâina dôn mak.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Male Agrippa han Festus kôm, “Hi miriem hin Caesar kôm tung rangin lei inzong no rese chu, ma reng hin mojôk thei rang piel ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Paul hah Rom taka rukuonga a se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Italy taka rukuonga se rangin kin masat lehan, Paul le intângna ina om senkhatngei hah “Rom râlmi pâl” ulien Julius kuta an bang ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Adramyttium renga rukuonga kin sea Asia ramhuol sûnga rukuong inngamna mâk rangin ânthoka male Aristarkus Macedonia rama Thessalonika khuo mi kin kôm a oma. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Anangtûka chu Sidon kin tunga. Julius han Paul hah lungkham a mua, male a malngei vântongpui rangin phalna a pêka a nângngei an lei pêk theina rangin. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Ma renga han kin se nôka, male phâivuon anôk tieng mi hong sêm sikin Cyprus tuihuola kâirêng omna tieng kin se zoia. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Cilicia rama tuikhanglien kin rakâna male Pamphylia le Lycia rama Myra kin hong zoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Mahan râlmi ulien han rukuong inkhat Alexandria renga hong Italy rama se rang a mua, masikin mahan mi min chuong zoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Nikhuo tamtak thâmin jâm jâmin kin sea male intak takin Cnidus khopuia kin tunga, phâivuo han ma tieng han mi min se thei maka, masikin kâirêng omna Crete tuihuol tieng asukin kin sea, Cape Salmone kin tung zoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Tuipâng kin vanâia male intak takin Rukuong Inngamna Hoi, an ti hah kin hong tunga, Lasea khopui renga hah labâk mak.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Mahan nikhuo tamtak kin min hek zoi sikin rukuong dêna se nôk rang hah chi a oma, Ratanna Nikhuo alei vun zoia, Masikin Paul'n hima rilna hih a pêk ngeia. <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>“Miriem ngei, atûn renga ei mântieng hi chu asân chi aom ti ku mua, sietna le inmangna lientak rukuong le a neinunngei chunga le ei ringna khom ânmang thei.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Aniatachu râlmi ulienpu han Paul chong jôm nêkin rukuonga ulienpu le rukuong pumangei chong a mindon ngei uola. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Rukuong inngamna hah phalbia omna rangin asaloi sikin mi tam uolin an omna renga sea, Phoenix an tung theia anin chu la tunga ma muna han phalbi la min hek rangin a min sûka. Phoenix chu Cret tuihuola rukuong inngamna inkhat thang-mâr le sak-mâr maiinthak ani.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuikhangliena phâivuopui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Thang phâivuo jâmin ahong lechu an mintuo tak ha an tho thei rangin an bôka, thîrrûi ha a kaisuoa Crete tuipâng tienga han nâi theidôra nâiin an jâpa. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Aniatachu chomolte ani lechu phâivuo râttak “Sak-sim” an ti ngâi hah tuihuol renga ajuong sêma. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Rukuong hah ajuong tokthapa, phâivuo mâithakin kin se thei khâiloi tena chu pût khâi makme phâivuon rukuong ha asemna titieng mi chôia. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Cauda tuihuol saktieng kin khêl lechu kâirêng chînte kin mana. Mahan, intak takin, rukuong sûnga rukuong chînte hah kin kêlsuo theia. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>An kêlsuo nûkin insanna rûi lehan rukuong nuoitieng an thunga an khitbela. Libya tuipânga sietsâia mi nôngpai atih, ti an chi sikin puonjâr hah an min nuoia, male phâivuon ajôtna titieng amin sêma. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Phâivuo hah ala rât tit sikin anangtûka chu neinun hah senkhat an vôr paia, <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>male hatûknôka chu rukuonga mangruo neinunngei ha an vôrpai nôka. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Nikhuo tamtak nisa, ârsingei khom inlang khâiloiin phâivuopui râtin ahong sêm tit sikin amongnataka chu ring rang khomin in sabei khâi makmea.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Masuole bunêk loia zora sôttak an om nûkin, Paul'n an motona ândinga male, “Miriemngei, ko chong hah nin rangâia Cret tuihuol renga ei juong khâiloi nirese chu hi sietna le inmangna hi tong loi rang ei nia. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Aniatachu atûn hin nangni ke ngên ratha inngamtakin om roi! tute nin ringna machân uol no tunui, rukuong hi vai kêng machânin aom rang. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Ata ki nia, a sin ki sin bang ngâipu Pathien vântîrton inkhat jânin han ko kôm a juonga. <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‘Paul, chi no roh! Caesar makunga lânding ngêt ni tih. Male Pathien asatna sikin rukuonga na champuingei ringna khom hôi pe ngei atih.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Masikin miriem ngei rathângamtakin om roi! Pathien ka sabei sikin mi juong ril angin nîng atih. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Aniatachu kho tuihuol pânga makhata mi chôi atih.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Mediterranean tuipuia jân sômleiminli phâivuopuiin mi chôi suo nûkin, jânchimripa rukuongpungei hah tânga suok thei rangin an mindona. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Masikin anni ngei han tui minkhina le an minkhia metres 40 ânthûka; chomolte suole chu ma angdên han an thoa metres 30 an man nôka. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Kho lungkâra makhat mi juong nông nih ti an chi sikin rukuong remei tieng thîrrûi minli dôr an juong mathâka khuovâr rang ngâklalin chubai an tho. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Hanchu rukuongpu ngei han, rukuong renga rotpai rang an pûta; rukuong chînte hah tuia an mathâka, rukuong moton tienga han thîrrûingei mathâk inlêmin an thoa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Aniatachu, Paul'n râlmi ulienpu kôm le râlmingei kôm, “Rukuongpungei hah rukuong chunga an om nônchu nin ring rangin sabeina om mak,” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Masikin, râlmingei han rukuong chînte rûi hah an âtsata, an min se zoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Khuo ahong vâr vângin, Paul'n, bunêk rangin a ngên ngeia: “Aviensûn ten hin sûn sômleiminli nin ngâkna ani zoia, male madôr zora sôt hi khoite sâkloi nêkloia nin om ani zoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Bunêk rangin nangni ke ngên, nin ring theina rangin. Nin lua samsang inkhat luo inmang no nih” a tia. <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Mahi a ti suole, Paul'n vâipôl senkhat a lâka anrênga makunga han Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila, a khoia an sâk phut zoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Anni ngei khom han an ratha ânngama an rêngin bu an nêk zoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Rukuonga miriem hah kin rêngin 276 kin ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Mitinin an khop dôr an nêk suole chu rukuong hah ajâng theina rangin bungei hah tuikhangliena an vôrpai zoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rukuong asiet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Khuo ahong vârin chu, rukuongpungei han kho mun mini rietthei mak ngeia, aniatachu, tui inkilna mun inkhat sietsâibil an mua, anithei nisenla chu ma mun han rukuong hah tâng makhâi ngêt rang an pûta. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Masika han thîrrûingei hah an âtsata, male tuikhangliena han an minngima, an jâpna thîrrûingei khom madên han an sûta, mântieng puon an mazara phâivuon ajôtna titieng atuong thei rang lam takin an min sânga sietsâibil an va muna tieng han an pan zoia. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Aniatachu tuisou inik inchunna taka kin lûta rukuong lu han tâng ava sika rukuong lu hah singinsa thei khâiloiin ân-ôk tita, rukuong remei tieng hah tuidârinsokin ahong suka akoi zoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Intângna ina intâng ngei hah tui inlieiin lei rot ni ngei ti sika han râlmingei han anrêngin that let rang an mintuoa. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Aniatachu, râlmi ulienpu han Paul hah mojôk rang a nuoma masikin hima anga an tho hah a khap ngeia, manêkin tui inliei thei ngei kai chu tui inlieia tâng lei kâi rangin; <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>adangngei khom thingpêk chunga aninônchu rukuong hârngei lehan tâng lei kâi rangin chong a pêk ngeia. Ma anghan kin rêngin damtakin tâng kin kâi zoi ani.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Malta tuihoula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Damtakin tuipânga kin hong lehan, tuihuol hah Malta ani ti kin riet zoi. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Ma rama mingei hah keini rangin mal satak an lei nia. Ruo ajuonga adâi sikin mei an thoa male kin rêngin uôt rangin min modôm ani. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Paul han thing pomkhat ava lâka meia a tuoa alum lehan murûl ahong jôka Paul kut hah a muchuka a kher tita. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Ma rama mingei han Paul kuta murûl akâi hah an mua, inkhat le inkhatin, “Ma miriempa hi mi thatpu kêng ani ngêt rang, tuikhanglien renga damin a hong jôka, aniatachu adika roijêkpu han min ring no nih,” an tia. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Hannirese, Paul han murûl hah mei lâia a hirthâk paia, khoite tiriêk mak. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Anni ngei han chu inthing a ta, aninônchu harenghan inletin a thi rang, ha an ôta. Hannisenla zora sôtzan an ôt suole khoite ati an mu loi lechu, an mindona hah an thûla, “Paul hi pathien kêng ani duo!” an ti zoi.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Ma mun le inla bâkloi han ram alekti a oma a puma chu, tuihuola an ruoipu lien a riming Publius ani. Ama han mulunghoitakin mi lei modôma sûnthum tena khuolmi kin chang ani. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Publius a pa hah jâlmun sûnga a oma, ritun le êksen damloi ani. Paul hah khâltana ava sea, chubai a thoa, a chunga a kutngei a minngama, a mindam zoi. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Masuole chu, ma tuihuola om damloi dangngei murdi an honga an dam zoi. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Neinun ngâihoipêk tamtak min pêka, male rukuonga kin se lehan, rukuonga kin om sûnga kin nâng rang ngei hah rukuonga an dar zoi.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malta renga Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Thânthum suole chu Alexandria renga rukuong inkhat han kin sea, ariming “Pathien Inphîr,” maha phalbia ma tuihuola alei om sai ani. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Syracuse khopuilien kin tunga male mahan sûnthum kin oma. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Ma renga hah kin se nôka male Rhegium khopuilien kin tunga. Anangtûka chu sim phâivuo ahonga, sûnnik sûngin Puteoli khopui kin tung zoi. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Mahan iempungei senkhat kin mua an kôm sûn sari nikhuo châm rangin min tia, masuole chu Rom kin hong zoi. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Rom taka iempungei han kin thurchi an rieta male alazan ten Appius khopuingeia bazar lei Tung-in Inthum ten han keini ngei leh intong rangin an honga. Paul'n a mu ngei lechu, Pathien kôm râisânchong a rîla mohôkna lientak ngei a man ani.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rom taka Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Rom kin tung lechu, Paul hah a rungpu râlmi inkhat leh atheivaia om rang an phal zoia.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Sûnthum suole chu Paul'n khotuola Juda ruoipungei hah intong rangin a koitûpa. An intûp suole, ama'n an kôm, “Ka champui Isrealngei, ei mipuingei chunga nônchu ei jât balam ei richibulngei renga ei manna chunga ite minchâina dôn khom no ronga, Jerusalema intâng ina min khuma male Rom ngei kuta mi bânga. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Chong min rekel suole, Rom ulienngeiin mi mojôk rang an nuoma, asikchu thi rang dôra ki minchâina ite an mu loi ani. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Aniatachu maha Judangei an makhal lechu, ki mingei lelê doi ngei rang jôt khom no ronga, Caesar kôm jêk rangin namnôl ko tho zoi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Sin 25:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Masikin kêng nangni inmupuia nangni chongpui rangin nangni ko koi ani. Maha atatak kêng, Ma sabeina hanchu Israelngei an sabeipu han zingjirûi leh thungin ma anghin ko om ani,” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Anni ngeiin a kôm han, “Judea renga nu chungroia lekhamuthuon khom ite man makme, ei miriem so renga juong ngei khomin no roi ngei aninônchu nu chunga asie juong ti mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Aniatachu nu huongvârngei hih riet rang kin nuom ani, asikchu muntina mingeiin no omna pâl hah an misîr minsiet ngâi kin riet,” an tia.<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Masikin Paul le nikhuo an khita, ma nikhuo han chu mi tamtak Paul omna han an honga. Jîng renga jânjîng ten an kôm Pathien Rêngram thurchi a misîr minthâr pe ngeia, Moses Balam le dêipungei miziekngei hah mangin Jisua thurchi min iem ngei rang a pûta. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Senkhatngeiin chu an iema, hannirese senkhatngeiin chu iem mak ngei. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Masikin anni le anni khom inngêi khâi mak ngeia, Paul'n hi chong inkhat hih a ti pe ngei suole: “Ratha Inthieng han dêipu Isaiah renga nin richibulngei kôma a lei misîr ha idôra adik mini. <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>Ama'n a kôm <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26,27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Sênla ma mingei kôm han va ti roh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Rangâi rangâi nin ta, aniatachu rietthei no tunui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">En en nin ta, aniatachu mu no tunui,<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>asikchu ma miriemngei an mindona hih ânmôl zoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">male an kuorngei hîprap an ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an mitngei sîng an tih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Aninônchu, an mitin a mu rang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an kuorin a riet rang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an mulungbôkngei han rietthei an ta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">male ko kôm hong kîr an tih, Pathien'n a ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">male keiman lei mindam ngei duoi nîng,’ ” a tia.<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Male Paul'n: “Nangnin nin riet rang chu, Pathien'n sanminringna chong hah Jentailngei kôm min pêl ani zoia. Anni ngei ke a lei rangâi rang!” tiin a khâr zoi.<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Kum nik ten chu Paul hah athena rang in man oma han a oma, male mahan ama mu nuoma ahong ngei murdi chu a lei modôm ani. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Pathien Rêngram thurchi a misîrpe ngeia male Pumapa Jisua Khrista thurchi a rila, tutên khap mak ngeia ngamtakin a misîr tit ani.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
